(194828, 11115, 806, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2003-01-20 00:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(194838, 11079, 4813, '<td valign="top">The best photo...should win</td>', 'The best photo...should win', '2003-01-20 00:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(194846, 11171, 4514, '<td valign="top">Too bad this is blurry<br/></td>', 'Too bad this is blurry', '2003-01-20 00:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(194849, 11115, 2123, '<td valign="top">hahahahaha....I wonder how many people have been around long enough to recognize this?  Great job</td>', 'hahahahaha....I wonder how many people have been around long enough to recognize this?  Great job', '2003-01-20 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(194851, 11310, 4514, '<td valign="top">Intresting.  Reshoot this with a White scrim or a white deflector on the right side to give a light ratio of 2:1.  I think you will be surprised.</td>', 'Intresting.  Reshoot this with a White scrim or a white deflector on the right side to give a light ratio of 2:1.  I think you will be surprised.', '2003-01-20 00:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(194856, 11288, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this shot, and I think it is effective.  I do think that a differently colored background would have helped give the picture a little more contrast, and grab the viewer more.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this shot, and I think it is effective.  I do think that a differently colored background would have helped give the picture a little more contrast, and grab the viewer more.', '2003-01-20 00:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(194861, 11200, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition and clarity.  The simplicity works well, and you haven''t overdone it with the lighting.</td>', 'Great composition and clarity.  The simplicity works well, and you haven''t overdone it with the lighting.', '2003-01-20 00:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(194864, 11208, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I expected a lot more similar to this in this challenge.  I love how you came out with the "oreo" covered perfectly in the milk and everything in focus as it should be.  Good shot!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I expected a lot more similar to this in this challenge.  I love how you came out with the "oreo" covered perfectly in the milk and everything in focus as it should be.  Good shot!', '2003-01-20 00:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(194866, 11152, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very cute and original.  I like the knowing, ''smiling'' look on the mother''s face.</td>', 'Very cute and original.  I like the knowing, ''smiling'' look on the mother''s face.', '2003-01-20 00:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(194870, 11229, 4267, '<td valign="top">help me out here before I vote... what am I looking at? thanks!<br/> <br/>oh wait is that cheese through a grater?</td>', 'help me out here before I vote... what am I looking at? thanks! oh wait is that cheese through a grater?', '2003-01-20 00:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(194873, 11175, 811, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent shot.  The cows'' colors provide good contrast, and it is well focused and well lit.  The only suggestion I might make is to not crop it quite so close on the left since you have a little space between the edge of the frame and the cow on the right.<br/>PS -- How are those cows kept so clean??????????</td>', 'this is an excellent shot.  The cows'' colors provide good contrast, and it is well focused and well lit.  The only suggestion I might make is to not crop it quite so close on the left since you have a little space between the edge of the frame and the cow on the right.PS -- How are those cows kept so clean??????????', '2003-01-20 00:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(194883, 11268, 5391, '<td valign="top">I really like the close-in crop, and even the lighting is good.  I''d like to see just a touch more overall sharpness, though, I think.  But it''s the most appetizing shot I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'I really like the close-in crop, and even the lighting is good.  I''d like to see just a touch more overall sharpness, though, I think.  But it''s the most appetizing shot I''ve seen so far.', '2003-01-20 00:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(194891, 11341, 1, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea though strangely lit.  The shadows at the top are distracting.  I''m thinking one more beam of light coming from the top wouldmake it perfect.</td>', 'Awesome idea though strangely lit.  The shadows at the top are distracting.  I''m thinking one more beam of light coming from the top wouldmake it perfect.', '2003-01-20 00:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(194892, 11341, 5391, '<td valign="top">Now that''s pretty cute.  Would have worked well for the humor challenge, too.  I really like the spotty lighting and dramatic shadows.</td>', 'Now that''s pretty cute.  Would have worked well for the humor challenge, too.  I really like the spotty lighting and dramatic shadows.', '2003-01-20 00:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(194896, 11187, 92, '<td valign="top">I like the balance and color tone this photo has. Very well done ! 10</td>', 'I like the balance and color tone this photo has. Very well done ! 10', '2003-01-20 00:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(194903, 11338, 92, '<td valign="top">The focus is great. The only issue I see is the shadow. A 2nd light would fix that. Nicely done :)  <br/></td>', 'The focus is great. The only issue I see is the shadow. A 2nd light would fix that. Nicely done :)  ', '2003-01-20 00:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
