(195223, 11184, 1863, '<td valign="top">A lovely image, it makes me want caffeine now! I like the way the (soy) milk lands and mixes in with the coffee. A clever shot, and I haven''t seen anybody else do it either, so it''s original :) The background really suits the photograph, and the composition is superb. Well done! Good luck in the challenge :) -Annida</td>', 'A lovely image, it makes me want caffeine now! I like the way the (soy) milk lands and mixes in with the coffee. A clever shot, and I haven''t seen anybody else do it either, so it''s original :) The background really suits the photograph, and the composition is superb. Well done! Good luck in the challenge :) -Annida', '2003-01-20 04:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(195226, 11268, 3540, '<td valign="top">This could stand to be just a little clearer.  The lighting is odd, but I like how the left background is brown and the right side is black. - Inspzil</td>', 'This could stand to be just a little clearer.  The lighting is odd, but I like how the left background is brown and the right side is black. - Inspzil', '2003-01-20 04:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(195228, 11162, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good action shot.  The contrasting colors work really well for this pic.  My favorite so far. - Inspzil</td>', 'Good action shot.  The contrasting colors work really well for this pic.  My favorite so far. - Inspzil', '2003-01-20 04:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
