(195233, 11310, 3540, '<td valign="top">You should''ve ironed your backdrop cloth.  I think the lighting needs to be a bit brighter as well. - Inspzil</td>', 'You should''ve ironed your backdrop cloth.  I think the lighting needs to be a bit brighter as well. - Inspzil', '2003-01-20 04:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(195236, 11321, 3540, '<td valign="top">I would''ve made the DOF of this pic much greater.   I don''t see the appeal to leaving some  of the blurry.  Maybe it''s just me... - Inspzil</td>', 'I would''ve made the DOF of this pic much greater.   I don''t see the appeal to leaving some  of the blurry.  Maybe it''s just me... - Inspzil', '2003-01-20 04:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(195237, 11115, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks like the flying toaster picture revisited.  Great colors, like the other.  I see its winter there too.  Unfortunately I don''t see this one being as successful - Inspzil</td>', 'This looks like the flying toaster picture revisited.  Great colors, like the other.  I see its winter there too.  Unfortunately I don''t see this one being as successful - Inspzil', '2003-01-20 04:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(195238, 11242, 3540, '<td valign="top">The top piece looks like a piece of fake play food like my kids have that is actually frosting for a cupcake.  I don''t know if it is, but it''s a dead ringer for it.  I like the backdrop and lighting.  I would''ve ditched the plate though.  Nice job - Inpszil</td>', 'The top piece looks like a piece of fake play food like my kids have that is actually frosting for a cupcake.  I don''t know if it is, but it''s a dead ringer for it.  I like the backdrop and lighting.  I would''ve ditched the plate though.  Nice job - Inpszil', '2003-01-20 04:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(195239, 11171, 3540, '<td valign="top">A lot going on here.  Unfortunately none of it is very clear.  Conceptually its pretty good.  The execution leaves much to be desired, like focus.  Lighting is pretty good too.  Good Luck - Inspzil</td>', 'A lot going on here.  Unfortunately none of it is very clear.  Conceptually its pretty good.  The execution leaves much to be desired, like focus.  Lighting is pretty good too.  Good Luck - Inspzil', '2003-01-20 04:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(195244, 11168, 3540, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been a great landscape shot.  The patterns in the snow from plowing are great.  I like how the farm is tucked into the middle of this pic neatly.  Nice job - Inspzil</td>', 'This would''ve been a great landscape shot.  The patterns in the snow from plowing are great.  I like how the farm is tucked into the middle of this pic neatly.  Nice job - Inspzil', '2003-01-20 05:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(195245, 11208, 2363, '<td valign="top">Shame about the speckles on the milk. Presumably this is because you had to drop the biscuit into the milk several times to get the shot.</td>', 'Shame about the speckles on the milk. Presumably this is because you had to drop the biscuit into the milk several times to get the shot.', '2003-01-20 05:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
