(195312, 11202, 4510, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and good balance, IMO the border is not quite right for this shot.</td>', 'Great lighting and good balance, IMO the border is not quite right for this shot.', '2003-01-20 07:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(195320, 11336, 3599, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and border.  It must have been difficult to get all of these things in focus.  I may have tried to get the end of the needle more in focus.  The shadow from the needle on the cream box is a bit distracting along with the one on the box of oj.  I think the best way to avoid that is to play with the angles of your light to minimize the shadows.  i don''t think you could completly avoid them but they might be less pronounced.  Good work and good luck.</td>', 'Nice picture and border.  It must have been difficult to get all of these things in focus.  I may have tried to get the end of the needle more in focus.  The shadow from the needle on the cream box is a bit distracting along with the one on the box of oj.  I think the best way to avoid that is to play with the angles of your light to minimize the shadows.  i don''t think you could completly avoid them but they might be less pronounced.  Good work and good luck.', '2003-01-20 08:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(195321, 11238, 3599, '<td valign="top">But then I can''t vote on anymore photos!  This is a great photo.  I would like to see this in color but the b&amp;w is fine.</td>', 'But then I can''t vote on anymore photos!  This is a great photo.  I would like to see this in color but the b&w is fine.', '2003-01-20 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
