(195714, 11301, 1005, '<td valign="top">Techincally, the photo is very well taken.  Very good color and focus.  The background is on the busy side, esp. with the blouses the girls are wearing.  Also, there''s something about the shadows on the wall...less than perfect.  Now, less seriously, the expressions on the girl''s faces are confusing.  The girl on the right seems serene, wistful, while the girl on the left seems almost terrified by the sight of the milk, both in her facial expression and the way she holds the glass.  Is this why the title has a question mark?  7 Swash</td>', 'Techincally, the photo is very well taken.  Very good color and focus.  The background is on the busy side, esp. with the blouses the girls are wearing.  Also, there''s something about the shadows on the wall...less than perfect.  Now, less seriously, the expressions on the girl''s faces are confusing.  The girl on the right seems serene, wistful, while the girl on the left seems almost terrified by the sight of the milk, both in her facial expression and the way she holds the glass.  Is this why the title has a question mark?  7 Swash', '2003-01-20 12:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(195717, 11247, 1005, '<td valign="top">Solarize!  Got any DQ requests?  This is totally legal, I recognize the effect.  It does give this a surreal, impressionistic view of this very recognizable standard.  I like it!  The rims of the glass and plate tell me the focus is good, but this effect might fool some into thinking the focus isn''t so good.  8 Swash</td>', 'Solarize!  Got any DQ requests?  This is totally legal, I recognize the effect.  It does give this a surreal, impressionistic view of this very recognizable standard.  I like it!  The rims of the glass and plate tell me the focus is good, but this effect might fool some into thinking the focus isn''t so good.  8 Swash', '2003-01-20 12:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(195719, 11191, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s taking one on the chin for the site!  Nice stop action!  Lots of mild drops flying around, really fun.  Did you want the drop''s shadows?  I might have tried doing this with a background further away, but it''s your choice.  8 Swash</td>', 'Wow, that''s taking one on the chin for the site!  Nice stop action!  Lots of mild drops flying around, really fun.  Did you want the drop''s shadows?  I might have tried doing this with a background further away, but it''s your choice.  8 Swash', '2003-01-20 12:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
