(195764, 11233, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute title, very good focus, but the color seems on the purple pink side.  Getting your subject further away from the wall would also help that strong shadow line.  7 Swash</td>', 'Cute title, very good focus, but the color seems on the purple pink side.  Getting your subject further away from the wall would also help that strong shadow line.  7 Swash', '2003-01-20 13:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(195778, 11053, 1005, '<td valign="top">Whoa, where do I start???  I forgot, start with the positive comment.   Very good focus and contrast in the central part of the pic.  O.K. these are beef cows, not milk cows (99.99% certain).  The standing in water part makes me shudder (I know it''s not fouling the meat, but still.....).  The fog off in the distance obsures the background, but not in a really good way.  I really want to nick you an extra point due to the beef cows thing, but I won''t.  6 Swash</td>', 'Whoa, where do I start???  I forgot, start with the positive comment.   Very good focus and contrast in the central part of the pic.  O.K. these are beef cows, not milk cows (99.99% certain).  The standing in water part makes me shudder (I know it''s not fouling the meat, but still.....).  The fog off in the distance obsures the background, but not in a really good way.  I really want to nick you an extra point due to the beef cows thing, but I won''t.  6 Swash', '2003-01-20 13:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(195781, 11175, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well done photo.  You''re going for the milk drinker, rather than milk producer?  Was there something at the blonde cow''s tail that needed to be cropped off?  (Tad close crop on that side, IMO) Strong focus.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very well done photo.  You''re going for the milk drinker, rather than milk producer?  Was there something at the blonde cow''s tail that needed to be cropped off?  (Tad close crop on that side, IMO) Strong focus.  8 Swash', '2003-01-20 13:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(195788, 11341, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo (get it?)  Fun and well taken.  I do question the shadows, but it''s not that it''s a bad thing, I just question it.  My biggest problem with this photo is the lower right corner.  I''m not certain of the white cheese is dirty, or if that''s some digital artifacts, but it''s not good.  (Same, but less so in the opposite corner.)   A tad too heavy glare on the mouse cord that''s in the sunlight.  BTW, go optical, they''re much more dependable!  8 Swash</td>', 'Very sharp photo (get it?)  Fun and well taken.  I do question the shadows, but it''s not that it''s a bad thing, I just question it.  My biggest problem with this photo is the lower right corner.  I''m not certain of the white cheese is dirty, or if that''s some digital artifacts, but it''s not good.  (Same, but less so in the opposite corner.)   A tad too heavy glare on the mouse cord that''s in the sunlight.  BTW, go optical, they''re much more dependable!  8 Swash', '2003-01-20 13:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(195799, 11198, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good picture, nice greens, interesting framing, but it''s a beef cow (note the complete lack of udders).  Were you going for milk user?  (It''s a bit old for that.)  My cow issues are really nits, I''m not going to ding your score for it.  Suggestion:  oppsite framing, so the cow is looking into the frame, not BA-ing it.  7 Swash</td>', 'Good picture, nice greens, interesting framing, but it''s a beef cow (note the complete lack of udders).  Were you going for milk user?  (It''s a bit old for that.)  My cow issues are really nits, I''m not going to ding your score for it.  Suggestion:  oppsite framing, so the cow is looking into the frame, not BA-ing it.  7 Swash', '2003-01-20 13:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
