(195986, 11247, 2373, '<td valign="top">This has posibilitys, it looks like you used an effect, maybe solorize or somthing.Maybe its just the pixelization due to image compression. Im not sure that this effect works with this image. It is very interesting and i like it but it seems to be missing somthing.</td>', 'This has posibilitys, it looks like you used an effect, maybe solorize or somthing.Maybe its just the pixelization due to image compression. Im not sure that this effect works with this image. It is very interesting and i like it but it seems to be missing somthing.', '2003-01-20 15:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(195988, 11191, 2373, '<td valign="top">This acuallu is a really good picture! Not one that i would hang on my wall....well maybe if it were me under the milk i would. Good job!</td>', 'This acuallu is a really good picture! Not one that i would hang on my wall....well maybe if it were me under the milk i would. Good job!', '2003-01-20 15:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
