(196180, 11189, 327, '<td valign="top">Konichiwa Polar bears...!!  Wow they look cold. Love this shot.....mostly the colors are just so exciting and true. The focus and light add to this neat shot.</td>', 'Konichiwa Polar bears...!!  Wow they look cold. Love this shot.....mostly the colors are just so exciting and true. The focus and light add to this neat shot.', '2003-01-20 17:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(196184, 11177, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work..good. I would of liked the cookie lower, in focus more, a bit soft as it is. Still I do love the focus of the glass and milk. Your light is almost 100% perfect...it''s 90%. ?I''m picky...  Rich colors with good depth. I like this shot. Good luck to you.</td>', 'Nice work..good. I would of liked the cookie lower, in focus more, a bit soft as it is. Still I do love the focus of the glass and milk. Your light is almost 100% perfect...it''s 90%. ?I''m picky...  Rich colors with good depth. I like this shot. Good luck to you.', '2003-01-20 17:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(196185, 11160, 327, '<td valign="top">Okay it''s a good shot....and it''s funny.....I love this. BAM!! you have room for a ribbon? Nice work! Congrats. Less is more here....works very very well.</td>', 'Okay it''s a good shot....and it''s funny.....I love this. BAM!! you have room for a ribbon? Nice work! Congrats. Less is more here....works very very well.', '2003-01-20 17:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(196187, 11327, 327, '<td valign="top">Great idea----pretty seal too. Clean, clear, crisp shot. Well done.</td>', 'Great idea----pretty seal too. Clean, clear, crisp shot. Well done.', '2003-01-20 17:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(196189, 11076, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, composition.</td>', 'Neat idea, composition.', '2003-01-20 18:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(196193, 11238, 327, '<td valign="top">This is just a fantastic idea...................your sooooooo clever. What a great idea. Wow. I give many 9''s and few 10''s. This is a 10 for originality.  Bravo to you.</td>', 'This is just a fantastic idea...................your sooooooo clever. What a great idea. Wow. I give many 9''s and few 10''s. This is a 10 for originality.  Bravo to you.', '2003-01-20 18:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
