(196199, 11115, 327, '<td valign="top">You''ve done it again. ........lol........ Don''t you wear a coat ??? You live in the ice box of the world and no coat-sitting on the ground. ?Amazing?. Amazing shot too. What a capture. Did you get soaked? It''s almost like the milk covered the mountians...neat.</td>', 'You''ve done it again. ........lol........ Don''t you wear a coat ??? You live in the ice box of the world and no coat-sitting on the ground. ?Amazing?. Amazing shot too. What a capture. Did you get soaked? It''s almost like the milk covered the mountians...neat.', '2003-01-20 18:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(196200, 11321, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.....two of them, like them both. Very creative idea. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this very much.....two of them, like them both. Very creative idea. Good luck.', '2003-01-20 18:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
