(196257, 11099, 3080, '<td valign="top">I get it.  There''s not much room in the fridge cause of all the beer.  Took me a minute, but I get it.  Pretty funny too.  very nice focus and clarity.  great color and lighting was nice for the shot as well.  The dairy is a small part of the photo, but no one said it had to be the MAIN subject.  Good angle and framing/cropping. I like the reflections on the ceiling. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I get it.  There''s not much room in the fridge cause of all the beer.  Took me a minute, but I get it.  Pretty funny too.  very nice focus and clarity.  great color and lighting was nice for the shot as well.  The dairy is a small part of the photo, but no one said it had to be the MAIN subject.  Good angle and framing/cropping. I like the reflections on the ceiling. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-20 18:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
