(196316, 11205, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The focus and clarity are great.  Love the colors in the cup and saucer.  The light glare in the upper left corner seems a bit out of place and draws attention away from the subject a tad bit, but nothing serious.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like how you have placed the cup in the lower right and left neg. space in the photo.  Nice shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The focus and clarity are great.  Love the colors in the cup and saucer.  The light glare in the upper left corner seems a bit out of place and draws attention away from the subject a tad bit, but nothing serious.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like how you have placed the cup in the lower right and left neg. space in the photo.  Nice shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-20 19:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
