(196326, 11301, 1031, '<td valign="top">Maybe not!</td>', 'Maybe not!', '2003-01-20 19:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(196336, 11189, 3080, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m missing the Dairy product in your photo.  I looked for it, I really did.  The shot as a whole is ok.  Nice colors and focus.  The angle and framing/cropping could use some attention though.  You cut off heads and feet.  Is the guy in the red undies your main subject?  If so, you might have tried a vertical crop.  Right now, the blue coat is taking up most of the space in your photo.  Sorry for not seeing how this meets the challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Maybe I''m missing the Dairy product in your photo.  I looked for it, I really did.  The shot as a whole is ok.  Nice colors and focus.  The angle and framing/cropping could use some attention though.  You cut off heads and feet.  Is the guy in the red undies your main subject?  If so, you might have tried a vertical crop.  Right now, the blue coat is taking up most of the space in your photo.  Sorry for not seeing how this meets the challenge.  Good luck.', '2003-01-20 19:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(196341, 11247, 1031, '<td valign="top">This shows visible banding effects on my monitor -- not sure if it''s intentional or not. If it is it has the effect of making it look partly "real" (esp. the cookies) and partly like an illustration. I''d have rotated it slightly to the right.</td>', 'This shows visible banding effects on my monitor -- not sure if it''s intentional or not. If it is it has the effect of making it look partly "real" (esp. the cookies) and partly like an illustration. I''d have rotated it slightly to the right.', '2003-01-20 19:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
