(196560, 11187, 5982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture but since we''re talking about milk I would have liked it more if more white than brown...  nice shot!</td>', 'Beautiful picture but since we''re talking about milk I would have liked it more if more white than brown...  nice shot!', '2003-01-20 21:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(196566, 11187, 811, '<td valign="top">Great focus and good job capturing the details on the glass with minmal light reflections.  Something about hte composition has me off-kilter though.  I think it is because the front glass and the back one are "almost" lined up,  and it feels like the back one should be scooted to the left just a touch, and the other three rotated counterclockwise to "fill" in the spaces.  Still, that is probably just me.  Great crop, and an overall great picture.</td>', 'Great focus and good job capturing the details on the glass with minmal light reflections.  Something about hte composition has me off-kilter though.  I think it is because the front glass and the back one are "almost" lined up,  and it feels like the back one should be scooted to the left just a touch, and the other three rotated counterclockwise to "fill" in the spaces.  Still, that is probably just me.  Great crop, and an overall great picture.', '2003-01-20 22:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(196569, 11268, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the crop and angle on this, but the focus is a little soft around the edges for my taste, I think.</td>', 'I love the crop and angle on this, but the focus is a little soft around the edges for my taste, I think.', '2003-01-20 22:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
