(196664, 11233, 3080, '<td valign="top">The color in this photo is just really really harsh.  She looks liek that little girl from Willy Wonka and the Chocolate Factory that ate the blueberry flavored gum and turned into a blueberry.  This woman looks purple.    The shot is definately dairy related. The angle and framing/cropping are ok, and the background isn''t distracting at all.  But the color is really off.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The color in this photo is just really really harsh.  She looks liek that little girl from Willy Wonka and the Chocolate Factory that ate the blueberry flavored gum and turned into a blueberry.  This woman looks purple.    The shot is definately dairy related. The angle and framing/cropping are ok, and the background isn''t distracting at all.  But the color is really off.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-20 23:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(196675, 11177, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very yummy shot.  The angle and framing/cropping is great.  The only thing that bothers me, and it''s not really a problem, just an observation. Is that the angle of the glass makes it seem like the milk should be pouring out and it isn''t even tilted. the cookie is in really good focus.   Love the clearness of the entire shot.  Background is perfect for this shot.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very yummy shot.  The angle and framing/cropping is great.  The only thing that bothers me, and it''s not really a problem, just an observation. Is that the angle of the glass makes it seem like the milk should be pouring out and it isn''t even tilted. the cookie is in really good focus.   Love the clearness of the entire shot.  Background is perfect for this shot.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-20 23:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
