(197010, 11301, 1041, '<td valign="top">well, the girl on the left certainly won''t drink milk if she doesn''t have to! ;)  this is a very well taken photograph of the two girls.  even lighting, sharp, nice catchlights in the eyes.  and it meets the challenge.  the material of the background is a little busy for my liking, but this is still a good shot.  :)</td>', 'well, the girl on the left certainly won''t drink milk if she doesn''t have to! ;)  this is a very well taken photograph of the two girls.  even lighting, sharp, nice catchlights in the eyes.  and it meets the challenge.  the material of the background is a little busy for my liking, but this is still a good shot.  :)', '2003-01-21 13:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(197012, 11236, 1041, '<td valign="top">have you ever tried vanilla soymilk mixed with orange juice?  sounds gross but is actually really yummy.  anyhow.  your photo definitely meets the challenge.  i like the beam on the soymilk bottle, definitely focuses your attention, even though the beam is just a little more overexposed than i would like.  overall, i think you did well achieving that heavenly feeling, great color for the background, and good arrangements of objects in your shot.  i wish the background did have a few less creases (noticeable on the right).  overall, a good submission :)</td>', 'have you ever tried vanilla soymilk mixed with orange juice?  sounds gross but is actually really yummy.  anyhow.  your photo definitely meets the challenge.  i like the beam on the soymilk bottle, definitely focuses your attention, even though the beam is just a little more overexposed than i would like.  overall, i think you did well achieving that heavenly feeling, great color for the background, and good arrangements of objects in your shot.  i wish the background did have a few less creases (noticeable on the right).  overall, a good submission :)', '2003-01-21 13:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
