(197863, 11080, 2716, '<td valign="top">There seems to be something missing here.  I think (and this is rarely the case) I would have liked to see fingers in the shot holding the cookie. Ilike the colours.  Good choice of background.    Jacko.</td>', 'There seems to be something missing here.  I think (and this is rarely the case) I would have liked to see fingers in the shot holding the cookie. Ilike the colours.  Good choice of background.    Jacko.', '2003-01-22 16:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
