(197865, 11282, 1078, '<td valign="top">Totally a personal preference: I think I would have tried to get the background a more pure white.  I like the form and simplicity and sense of action in the shot.  I have to admit, I can''t figure out exactly what it is, but that''s not stopping me from likiing it.</td>', 'Totally a personal preference: I think I would have tried to get the background a more pure white.  I like the form and simplicity and sense of action in the shot.  I have to admit, I can''t figure out exactly what it is, but that''s not stopping me from likiing it.', '2003-01-22 16:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(197867, 11299, 2716, '<td valign="top">How romantic.  To show my love on this Valentine''s Day, I have bought you a quart of milk.  lol.  Nice shot.  Thanks for the chuckles.  Jacko.</td>', 'How romantic.  To show my love on this Valentine''s Day, I have bought you a quart of milk.  lol.  Nice shot.  Thanks for the chuckles.  Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(197869, 11307, 2716, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the chuckles.  The picture looks messy, but the concept is still funny.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Thanks for the chuckles.  The picture looks messy, but the concept is still funny.  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-22 17:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(197870, 11074, 1078, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of a stock photography shot -- which is not a bad thing.  Nice sense of motion by shooting at the angle you used.  Wondering how hammered you''r getting for not using any actual dairy in the shot but just alluding to it.  Works for me, but then I''m not a voter so....</td>', 'Makes me think of a stock photography shot -- which is not a bad thing.  Nice sense of motion by shooting at the angle you used.  Wondering how hammered you''r getting for not using any actual dairy in the shot but just alluding to it.  Works for me, but then I''m not a voter so....', '2003-01-22 17:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(197872, 11099, 2716, '<td valign="top">LOL. That''s funny.  The old food or beer delima.  Jacko.</td>', 'LOL. That''s funny.  The old food or beer delima.  Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(197873, 11184, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.  The background is a bit too busy (maybe use less depth of field if possible), but I like the shot as a whole.  Jacko.  9.</td>', 'Nice framing.  The background is a bit too busy (maybe use less depth of field if possible), but I like the shot as a whole.  Jacko.  9.', '2003-01-22 17:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(197874, 11160, 1078, '<td valign="top">I dig the concept and the lighting.  My "nit" is that the back of the glass is not as evenly "frosted" as the front appears to be -- lots of little nicks for one, and then just not as smoothly "frosted" either -- almost as if it''s got fingerprints or something that were then frosted over.  I''m not explaing myself well.  Still one of my more favorite shots...</td>', 'I dig the concept and the lighting.  My "nit" is that the back of the glass is not as evenly "frosted" as the front appears to be -- lots of little nicks for one, and then just not as smoothly "frosted" either -- almost as if it''s got fingerprints or something that were then frosted over.  I''m not explaing myself well.  Still one of my more favorite shots...', '2003-01-22 17:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(197877, 11204, 1078, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  Pure and simple.  Three things about it, however, bother me -- one is relatively stupid and can be ignored, another is probably just an overactive imagination (and is actually a compliment), and the third I''m not entirely certain what more you could have done to minimize.  First, the cheese on the cheese board/tray look a little too symmetricaly laid out.  Like I said, dumb, but there ya go.  Second, something about the shot makes me feel like it was literally taken from a magazine.  I think it has something to do with the colors.  If it was, shame on you.  If it wasn''t, then congratulations and well done.  *grin*  Finally, the far background is a little distracting because my eyes are led around the picture and objects seem to keep leading me up to it.  I start down with the cheeses, move up to the bread and knife, over to the wine and glass and then over to that empty spot of table and background.  Then I start looking around back there to see what I can see.  Perhaps a slightly more shallow depth of field to blur that out a bit -- coupled with perhaps a bit more light to darken it down a tad?  At any rate, know that I''m not a voter, so you can take the comments for what they''re worth.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  Pure and simple.  Three things about it, however, bother me -- one is relatively stupid and can be ignored, another is probably just an overactive imagination (and is actually a compliment), and the third I''m not entirely certain what more you could have done to minimize.  First, the cheese on the cheese board/tray look a little too symmetricaly laid out.  Like I said, dumb, but there ya go.  Second, something about the shot makes me feel like it was literally taken from a magazine.  I think it has something to do with the colors.  If it was, shame on you.  If it wasn''t, then congratulations and well done.  *grin*  Finally, the far background is a little distracting because my eyes are led around the picture and objects seem to keep leading me up to it.  I start down with the cheeses, move up to the bread and knife, over to the wine and glass and then over to that empty spot of table and background.  Then I start looking around back there to see what I can see.  Perhaps a slightly more shallow depth of field to blur that out a bit -- coupled with perhaps a bit more light to darken it down a tad?  At any rate, know that I''m not a voter, so you can take the comments for what they''re worth.', '2003-01-22 17:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(197878, 11115, 1078, '<td valign="top">Ripping off your own stuff, huh?  Tsk, tsk, tsk.  *grin*  Nice spread on the milk and the color on the snow is a great complement to the color in the sky.  Similar kinds of "nits" to my comment on the last one -- I just don''t like where the lines in the background are cutting through your subject.  The far mountains are a little too in line with his head and the open space behind him almost "cuts off his head."  Silly little things.  And since I''m not voting, take them for what they are -- comments of a deranged mind.</td>', 'Ripping off your own stuff, huh?  Tsk, tsk, tsk.  *grin*  Nice spread on the milk and the color on the snow is a great complement to the color in the sky.  Similar kinds of "nits" to my comment on the last one -- I just don''t like where the lines in the background are cutting through your subject.  The far mountains are a little too in line with his head and the open space behind him almost "cuts off his head."  Silly little things.  And since I''m not voting, take them for what they are -- comments of a deranged mind.', '2003-01-22 17:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(197881, 11198, 4267, '<td valign="top">come on get closer! show us the cow! :o) good colors though... a tighter crop on the right would help too</td>', 'come on get closer! show us the cow! :o) good colors though... a tighter crop on the right would help too', '2003-01-22 17:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(197883, 11211, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  I like it.  Jacko</td>', 'Nice and simple.  I like it.  Jacko', '2003-01-22 17:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(197884, 11202, 4267, '<td valign="top">good composition however the shadow is kind of distracting.. I think a dark colored background might work better... that would give the milk something to contrast against and perhaps hide the shadow... then again I would have to see it like that to be sure... try it and see :o) good luck</td>', 'good composition however the shadow is kind of distracting.. I think a dark colored background might work better... that would give the milk something to contrast against and perhaps hide the shadow... then again I would have to see it like that to be sure... try it and see :o) good luck', '2003-01-22 17:21:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(197885, 11115, 2716, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  NIce spoof.  Good job.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Ha ha!  NIce spoof.  Good job.  Jacko.  9', '2003-01-22 17:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(197888, 11282, 2716, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  I really don''t know what I''m looking at here.    Looks like a pure white background would have worked better to highlight the "yogourt".  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Hmmm.  I really don''t know what I''m looking at here.    Looks like a pure white background would have worked better to highlight the "yogourt".  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-22 17:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(197889, 11307, 4267, '<td valign="top">funny idea.. making the cheese more symetrical in the shot might help... and something about the lighting bothers me.. but I can''t deside what exactlly that is... color or intensity I think...</td>', 'funny idea.. making the cheese more symetrical in the shot might help... and something about the lighting bothers me.. but I can''t deside what exactlly that is... color or intensity I think...', '2003-01-22 17:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(197891, 11112, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice high-key shot -- excellent idea and composition.  First, not a voter -- so you can take these comments for what you will.  Have you considered completely desaturating this to B&amp;W, then making your shadows just a tad darker (bringing your shadow level just to the point where the histogram barely shows any shadows), and your midtones just a bit lighter (that one''s just a taste thing)?  The level settings in PS that I was looking at were 32, 1.5, and 255.  Just a suggestion based on my own personal taste.  Now going to delete your image from my PS file.  ;-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice high-key shot -- excellent idea and composition.  First, not a voter -- so you can take these comments for what you will.  Have you considered completely desaturating this to B&W, then making your shadows just a tad darker (bringing your shadow level just to the point where the histogram barely shows any shadows), and your midtones just a bit lighter (that one''s just a taste thing)?  The level settings in PS that I was looking at were 32, 1.5, and 255.  Just a suggestion based on my own personal taste.  Now going to delete your image from my PS file.  ;-)  Good luck.', '2003-01-22 17:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(197892, 11242, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the shot right upt to the point where we see the spoon, plate and birght table cloth ... too mnay contrasting colours.  I still think it is nicely executed (very sharp, nice exposure).  Jacko.</td>', 'I like the shot right upt to the point where we see the spoon, plate and birght table cloth ... too mnay contrasting colours.  I still think it is nicely executed (very sharp, nice exposure).  Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(197894, 11082, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  La vache qui rit.  (thought that was Canadian?).  I like the contrasting colours.  One thing I would absolutely change:  rotate the shot to make the Low Fat Milk sign level, the angle is disorienting.  Jacko.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  La vache qui rit.  (thought that was Canadian?).  I like the contrasting colours.  One thing I would absolutely change:  rotate the shot to make the Low Fat Milk sign level, the angle is disorienting.  Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(197895, 11247, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot. I like the composition.  I''m not crazy about the (over saturation?) effect.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Nice simple shot. I like the composition.  I''m not crazy about the (over saturation?) effect.  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-22 17:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(197898, 11198, 2716, '<td valign="top">NIce shot.  Great negative space.  Might want to crop the image to exclude the top right corner (darker) and the left top corner (trees), to really highlight the main focal point, ie. the cow.  Good job.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'NIce shot.  Great negative space.  Might want to crop the image to exclude the top right corner (darker) and the left top corner (trees), to really highlight the main focal point, ie. the cow.  Good job.  Jacko.  8', '2003-01-22 17:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(197900, 11113, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute composition.  I thiink it would be more appealing on plain vanilla ice cream (better contrast and less yellowish).  Jacko.</td>', 'Cute composition.  I thiink it would be more appealing on plain vanilla ice cream (better contrast and less yellowish).  Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(197902, 11336, 2716, '<td valign="top">Seems to be too many focul points.  They are all competing for my attention.</td>', 'Seems to be too many focul points.  They are all competing for my attention.', '2003-01-22 17:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(197905, 11072, 2716, '<td valign="top">Milk hole?  LIke a black hole in a parallel universe?  lol.  I''m not sure why this shot transformed to balck and white.  Seems a bit too dark.  I''d like to see more white since it''s supposed to be milk.</td>', 'Milk hole?  LIke a black hole in a parallel universe?  lol.  I''m not sure why this shot transformed to balck and white.  Seems a bit too dark.  I''d like to see more white since it''s supposed to be milk.', '2003-01-22 17:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(197907, 11310, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Seems a bit dark.  Should used a stronger light source or brighten up with an editing software.  Sure looks tasty!  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Nice composition.  Seems a bit dark.  Should used a stronger light source or brighten up with an editing software.  Sure looks tasty!  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-22 17:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(197910, 11307, 1041, '<td valign="top">hehehe, if he says cheese all the cheese is going to fall out of his mouth! ;)  good idea for the challenge.  great focus on the photo, and i like the way it is framed (that includes the frame, too).  i really have nothing to add that i would''ve done differently.  :)</td>', 'hehehe, if he says cheese all the cheese is going to fall out of his mouth! ;)  good idea for the challenge.  great focus on the photo, and i like the way it is framed (that includes the frame, too).  i really have nothing to add that i would''ve done differently.  :)', '2003-01-22 17:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(197911, 11162, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  I''d like to see more of the strawberry and splash.  Seems a bit tighly cropped.  I love th ''whitness'' you were able to achieve. Might be able to reduce the shadow with more than one light source.  Jacko.</td>', 'Cute shot.  I''d like to see more of the strawberry and splash.  Seems a bit tighly cropped.  I love th ''whitness'' you were able to achieve. Might be able to reduce the shadow with more than one light source.  Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(197916, 11175, 2716, '<td valign="top">The image seems somehow compressed horizontally (squeezed).  I dunno, maybe just he angle the cows are standing.  I like it.  Neat how both cows are looking at the camera.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'The image seems somehow compressed horizontally (squeezed).  I dunno, maybe just he angle the cows are standing.  I like it.  Neat how both cows are looking at the camera.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8', '2003-01-22 17:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(197918, 11200, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like tha angle of the corn and the textured feel of the image.  The only thing I''d like to see is the butter melting.  Would add a bit more realism to the shot.  Good job and good luck.  Jacko.   9  Oh yeah, nice job on the sharpness.</td>', 'Great shot.  I like tha angle of the corn and the textured feel of the image.  The only thing I''d like to see is the butter melting.  Would add a bit more realism to the shot.  Good job and good luck.  Jacko.   9  Oh yeah, nice job on the sharpness.', '2003-01-22 17:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(197919, 11282, 1041, '<td valign="top">hm.  i wonder how many comments you are getting from people that don''t get it.  or that say that this doesn''t meet the challenge.  i''m not sure, either.  the only thing i can think of is that this might be the lid of a yoghurt carton.  i think a different background color could''ve enhanced this, i would''ve also liked this better in an abstract challenge rather than a milk/cheese kind of challenge, but that''s just my personal taste.  overall, other than speculating what it is, my interest isn''t held very long by your photo, while the lid leads my eye through the picture, i am searching for something additional to also look at ...</td>', 'hm.  i wonder how many comments you are getting from people that don''t get it.  or that say that this doesn''t meet the challenge.  i''m not sure, either.  the only thing i can think of is that this might be the lid of a yoghurt carton.  i think a different background color could''ve enhanced this, i would''ve also liked this better in an abstract challenge rather than a milk/cheese kind of challenge, but that''s just my personal taste.  overall, other than speculating what it is, my interest isn''t held very long by your photo, while the lid leads my eye through the picture, i am searching for something additional to also look at ...', '2003-01-22 17:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(197920, 11236, 3032, '<td valign="top">Who''s dpc''s most famous vegetarian!? :)<br/> <br/>Great work with the lighting of this. The bright beam towards and behind the packet is very cool, yet the exposure of the other items in the frame is very good. Excellent lighting.<br/>I like how all the blue works. The combination of background, foreground subjects and background main subject is very pleasing to the eye.<br/>Nice composition. <br/> <br/>This is almost advertisement quality. The only negative is the somewhat sloppy background at the right.</td>', 'Who''s dpc''s most famous vegetarian!? :) Great work with the lighting of this. The bright beam towards and behind the packet is very cool, yet the exposure of the other items in the frame is very good. Excellent lighting.I like how all the blue works. The combination of background, foreground subjects and background main subject is very pleasing to the eye.Nice composition.  This is almost advertisement quality. The only negative is the somewhat sloppy background at the right.', '2003-01-22 17:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(197922, 11227, 3032, '<td valign="top">Shagadelic!<br/>Good exposure, nice clean shot, funny subject.<br/>But why are they wrapped in that black textile? Censorship? :)<br/></td>', 'Shagadelic!Good exposure, nice clean shot, funny subject.But why are they wrapped in that black textile? Censorship? :)', '2003-01-22 17:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(197923, 11322, 1041, '<td valign="top">i bet you are getting comments about the size of this photo.  it is hard to see all the details, and it would have been nice if you''d used a width of at least 500 pixels (i know your photo''s size is perfectly legal, i''m just telling you what i''d prefer :).  the colors are great, so is the idea.  nice sharpness, and the milk on the beak is a nice touch.</td>', 'i bet you are getting comments about the size of this photo.  it is hard to see all the details, and it would have been nice if you''d used a width of at least 500 pixels (i know your photo''s size is perfectly legal, i''m just telling you what i''d prefer :).  the colors are great, so is the idea.  nice sharpness, and the milk on the beak is a nice touch.', '2003-01-22 17:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(197925, 11301, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute girls.  They look like they really like milk.  The girl on the right is just too cute and I like the look on the face of the girl on the left.  One thing though: you might want to watch out for your selection of backgrounds next time; it''s a bit too busy, especially since the girls have wild patterns on their clothing.  Goo luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'Cute girls.  They look like they really like milk.  The girl on the right is just too cute and I like the look on the face of the girl on the left.  One thing though: you might want to watch out for your selection of backgrounds next time; it''s a bit too busy, especially since the girls have wild patterns on their clothing.  Goo luck.  Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(197926, 11341, 2716, '<td valign="top">ha!  Cute idea.  I like it.  The only thing I''d change.  Get better lighting next time.  Seems a bit patchy.  Good luck.  Jakco.  7</td>', 'ha!  Cute idea.  I like it.  The only thing I''d change.  Get better lighting next time.  Seems a bit patchy.  Good luck.  Jakco.  7', '2003-01-22 17:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(197928, 11112, 3032, '<td valign="top">Beautiful how the subtle tone differences work out.<br/>Very nice composition. The droplets of milk on the flower seem to add something. When I imagine the image without them it seems more empty.<br/>Not a straight line to be seen, very natural, nice.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful how the subtle tone differences work out.Very nice composition. The droplets of milk on the flower seem to add something. When I imagine the image without them it seems more empty.Not a straight line to be seen, very natural, nice.', '2003-01-22 17:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(197929, 11233, 2716, '<td valign="top">The colours seem way off.  I''m not sure if this was the intended effect, but I don''t find the purple hue on her face too flattering.  The background is also strange.  Nice composition, bad colou scheme.  Jacko.  6</td>', 'The colours seem way off.  I''m not sure if this was the intended effect, but I don''t find the purple hue on her face too flattering.  The background is also strange.  Nice composition, bad colou scheme.  Jacko.  6', '2003-01-22 17:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(197931, 11160, 2716, '<td valign="top">Intersting angle. The glass seems foggy.  Did you place it in the freezer.  Nice background.</td>', 'Intersting angle. The glass seems foggy.  Did you place it in the freezer.  Nice background.', '2003-01-22 17:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(197932, 11189, 2716, '<td valign="top">Funny picture; would have been great for the photojournalism challenge.  I really find the title to be a stretch though.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Funny picture; would have been great for the photojournalism challenge.  I really find the title to be a stretch though.  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-22 17:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(197933, 11238, 3032, '<td valign="top">Somehow this looks so classic, so early twentieth century. Very cool.<br/>Nice subtle angle of the text, I like it how the milk diffuses the upper and lower text to create a really strong "BACK".<br/>This is something I would go and look at in a museum/gallery. Very nice.</td>', 'Somehow this looks so classic, so early twentieth century. Very cool.Nice subtle angle of the text, I like it how the milk diffuses the upper and lower text to create a really strong "BACK".This is something I would go and look at in a museum/gallery. Very nice.', '2003-01-22 17:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(197935, 11154, 2716, '<td valign="top">Intersting colours.  That I like.  I''m not crazy about the motion blur on the milk.  Nice background.  Fits the challenge.  Jacko.</td>', 'Intersting colours.  That I like.  I''m not crazy about the motion blur on the milk.  Nice background.  Fits the challenge.  Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(197936, 11171, 2716, '<td valign="top">Don''t cry over spilled milk.  I like the idea, but the picture seems a bit messy because of the motion blur on the cat.  Good luck.</td>', 'Don''t cry over spilled milk.  I like the idea, but the picture seems a bit messy because of the motion blur on the cat.  Good luck.', '2003-01-22 17:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(197937, 11152, 2716, '<td valign="top">Them be alot of tities.  Nice capture.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Them be alot of tities.  Nice capture.  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-22 17:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(197939, 11242, 3032, '<td valign="top">Very clean and sharp pic.<br/>Good depth, altough the background would be a lot better blurred. I like it how the read edge of the saucer and the tip of the spoon are in the field of focus.<br/>Good colors and excellent lighting.<br/>But the background seems so out of place, it doesn''t relate to the icecream at all.</td>', 'Very clean and sharp pic.Good depth, altough the background would be a lot better blurred. I like it how the read edge of the saucer and the tip of the spoon are in the field of focus.Good colors and excellent lighting.But the background seems so out of place, it doesn''t relate to the icecream at all.', '2003-01-22 17:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(197940, 11305, 2716, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the angle on this one.  It feels to disorienting.  The cookies look a bit funny too.  would work better with oreos or chocolate chips.  Having said all that, I like the pouring motion and the composition ( of the glass, milk, and pitcher only), so I''ll give you an 8.   Jacko.</td>', 'I don''t like the angle on this one.  It feels to disorienting.  The cookies look a bit funny too.  would work better with oreos or chocolate chips.  Having said all that, I like the pouring motion and the composition ( of the glass, milk, and pitcher only), so I''ll give you an 8.   Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(197942, 11202, 2716, '<td valign="top">That''s original!  The one thing I''d change:  the shadow is distracting.  Maybe consider using more than one light source next time.  Still a very nice composition.  Jacko.  9    Good luck.</td>', 'That''s original!  The one thing I''d change:  the shadow is distracting.  Maybe consider using more than one light source next time.  Still a very nice composition.  Jacko.  9    Good luck.', '2003-01-22 17:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(197943, 11338, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute composition, however the design on the table cloth is too busy for my taste.    I like the look of the set up for the milk and cookies.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cute composition, however the design on the table cloth is too busy for my taste.    I like the look of the set up for the milk and cookies.  Good luck.', '2003-01-22 17:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(197948, 11168, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Would have been nice for the Landscape challenge too.  Good luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'Cute idea.  Would have been nice for the Landscape challenge too.  Good luck.  Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(197950, 11074, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition.  I like the angle.</td>', 'Nice simple composition.  I like the angle.', '2003-01-22 17:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(197951, 11284, 2716, '<td valign="top">Good stop motion.  Next time you might want to place the subject away from the background to avoid getting distracting shadows.  I hope you had fun eating your props.  Good luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'Good stop motion.  Next time you might want to place the subject away from the background to avoid getting distracting shadows.  I hope you had fun eating your props.  Good luck.  Jacko.', '2003-01-22 17:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(197952, 11233, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice to see the face this time. Funny idea and good pose, composition is good.<br/> <br/>But the use of flash has created some very harsh hard shadows around the right side of the face and shoulder, on the right side of the nose and around the packet of butter. Diffused flash light or bounce flash would have a much better natural lighting effect. Don''t know to which extent that is possible.<br/>And you''ll possibly disagree with me again, but the whitebalance is off. The color of the flash light is very blue and needs a manual whitebalance setting to create more natural colours istantly. Now the face looks violet/purple.</td>', 'Nice to see the face this time. Funny idea and good pose, composition is good. But the use of flash has created some very harsh hard shadows around the right side of the face and shoulder, on the right side of the nose and around the packet of butter. Diffused flash light or bounce flash would have a much better natural lighting effect. Don''t know to which extent that is possible.And you''ll possibly disagree with me again, but the whitebalance is off. The color of the flash light is very blue and needs a manual whitebalance setting to create more natural colours istantly. Now the face looks violet/purple.', '2003-01-22 18:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(197980, 11338, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job, this looks appealing.  Bg works well too.</td>', 'Good job, this looks appealing.  Bg works well too.', '2003-01-22 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
