(198255, 11329, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice warm feel to the photos with the color tone.  Maybe would have used a plainer bowl to focus on your subject a bit more, and one that didn''t make those reflections on the upper right of the bowl.  Love the title and the way the light hits the milk stream on the side.</td>', 'Nice warm feel to the photos with the color tone.  Maybe would have used a plainer bowl to focus on your subject a bit more, and one that didn''t make those reflections on the upper right of the bowl.  Love the title and the way the light hits the milk stream on the side.', '2003-01-23 00:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(198258, 11115, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great shot, (again?)  Where''s the toast?!  Colors, composition, and clarity excellent, as well as the humor.  The clouds in teh background and snow on the ground repeat the colors of the milk.  Great job, 10.</td>', 'Great shot, (again?)  Where''s the toast?!  Colors, composition, and clarity excellent, as well as the humor.  The clouds in teh background and snow on the ground repeat the colors of the milk.  Great job, 10.', '2003-01-23 00:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
