(198265, 11336, 5212, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition with originality meeting the challenge.  There is something about the border on the cream carton that bothers me a little for some reason.  The lighting is nice, and I really like the drops on the orange juice carton, wish they were also on the cream box!</td>', 'Interesting composition with originality meeting the challenge.  There is something about the border on the cream carton that bothers me a little for some reason.  The lighting is nice, and I really like the drops on the orange juice carton, wish they were also on the cream box!', '2003-01-23 00:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(198270, 11113, 5212, '<td valign="top">ONe of my favorites this week.  Gave it a 10! !  The only thing I might try to do to improve it is to try to get less reflection in the lower left area of the ice cream, although the reflections on the strawberries help make them look really fresh and yummy.</td>', 'ONe of my favorites this week.  Gave it a 10! !  The only thing I might try to do to improve it is to try to get less reflection in the lower left area of the ice cream, although the reflections on the strawberries help make them look really fresh and yummy.', '2003-01-23 00:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(198271, 11072, 5212, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, maybe, interesting shot, looks like it was difficult to shoot.</td>', 'A little grainy, maybe, interesting shot, looks like it was difficult to shoot.', '2003-01-23 00:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(198274, 11112, 5212, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, can''t find anything I might improve on, except that the part of the flower in the lower right was a bit more in focus.  Love the composition, originality in meeting the challenge, cropping is great, along with use of lighting and overall clarity of a very difficult shot.  10</td>', 'Beautiful shot, can''t find anything I might improve on, except that the part of the flower in the lower right was a bit more in focus.  Love the composition, originality in meeting the challenge, cropping is great, along with use of lighting and overall clarity of a very difficult shot.  10', '2003-01-23 00:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
