(198278, 11168, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, use of depth.  I really like the lighting on the foreground, but it takes my eye off the focal point a bit.  Love the way the trees and other lines lead to the dairy farm, however.  8</td>', 'Nice composition, use of depth.  I really like the lighting on the foreground, but it takes my eye off the focal point a bit.  Love the way the trees and other lines lead to the dairy farm, however.  8', '2003-01-23 00:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
