(198281, 11307, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great idea to meet the challenge.  I might have chosen a different shirt on the child to help prevent the red reflections on the left face and neck, and maybe differ the lighting a bit so the left side doesn''t look overly smooth.  Very cute, nonetheless</td>', 'Great idea to meet the challenge.  I might have chosen a different shirt on the child to help prevent the red reflections on the left face and neck, and maybe differ the lighting a bit so the left side doesn''t look overly smooth.  Very cute, nonetheless', '2003-01-23 00:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(198282, 11341, 5212, '<td valign="top">How cute, it looks like this mouse is sneaking around in the dark with the lighting as it is.   Might have liked the lighting a bit more subdued in the lower right and upper left, if I was being picky.  Very original way to meet the challenge well.</td>', 'How cute, it looks like this mouse is sneaking around in the dark with the lighting as it is.   Might have liked the lighting a bit more subdued in the lower right and upper left, if I was being picky.  Very original way to meet the challenge well.', '2003-01-23 00:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
