(198291, 11205, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot with good composition.  Might have it a bit better without the red area and reflection in the upper left corner, just a little more cropping would have eliminated the red.  Maybe a different type of surface under the cup and snack, too.  or a move away from that seam in the hardwood in front of the cup.  Nice work, anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice clear shot with good composition.  Might have it a bit better without the red area and reflection in the upper left corner, just a little more cropping would have eliminated the red.  Maybe a different type of surface under the cup and snack, too.  or a move away from that seam in the hardwood in front of the cup.  Nice work, anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-23 00:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
