(198342, 11177, 1829, '<td valign="top">Oh I love this macro shot.  I really like how the milk hasn''t been spilled and left a white mark on the glass, it is perfectly rounded in the glass.  Excellent job there.  Also, it makes me HUNGRY - LOL.  Great work and GL.</td>', 'Oh I love this macro shot.  I really like how the milk hasn''t been spilled and left a white mark on the glass, it is perfectly rounded in the glass.  Excellent job there.  Also, it makes me HUNGRY - LOL.  Great work and GL.', '2003-01-23 02:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(198343, 11204, 1829, '<td valign="top">A beautiful collection of country ingredients.  The setting is absolutely beautiful.  I see a lot of thought has been put into this photo.  Great job and GL.</td>', 'A beautiful collection of country ingredients.  The setting is absolutely beautiful.  I see a lot of thought has been put into this photo.  Great job and GL.', '2003-01-23 02:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(198344, 11211, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  I really like the shadow effect bouncing off each milk glass.  Beautiful colours.  10 for this beauty..</td>', 'Excellent composition.  I really like the shadow effect bouncing off each milk glass.  Beautiful colours.  10 for this beauty..', '2003-01-23 02:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198345, 11329, 1829, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like how you have captured the milk flowing into the bowl.  Great job and GL.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like how you have captured the milk flowing into the bowl.  Great job and GL.', '2003-01-23 02:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(198346, 11175, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  Composition is great as well.  I also like the way the shadow is off the brown cow.  Nice job..gl.</td>', 'Excellent capture.  Composition is great as well.  I also like the way the shadow is off the brown cow.  Nice job..gl.', '2003-01-23 02:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(198347, 11189, 1829, '<td valign="top">Ohhh looks cold, and the guy with the red jocks on looks like he could do with a hot cup of milk.  Great capture.  GL</td>', 'Ohhh looks cold, and the guy with the red jocks on looks like he could do with a hot cup of milk.  Great capture.  GL', '2003-01-23 02:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(198349, 11152, 1829, '<td valign="top">Awe what a darling.  Just look at those pigletts.  Well you have won my heart here.  Great job and GL.</td>', 'Awe what a darling.  Just look at those pigletts.  Well you have won my heart here.  Great job and GL.', '2003-01-23 02:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(198350, 11202, 1829, '<td valign="top">Ok now this deserves a 10 for sure.  I wanted to do one similar, but.....  I love the composition and the shadow work here.  Excellent work and GL.</td>', 'Ok now this deserves a 10 for sure.  I wanted to do one similar, but.....  I love the composition and the shadow work here.  Excellent work and GL.', '2003-01-23 02:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(198352, 11053, 1829, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the ''farm''.  I like the use of B&amp;W here as well.  GL.</td>', 'Great shot of the ''farm''.  I like the use of B&W here as well.  GL.', '2003-01-23 02:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(198353, 11076, 1829, '<td valign="top">Your shot stood out for me in the thumbnails, I guess it was because of the colour and the composition.  Well done and GL.</td>', 'Your shot stood out for me in the thumbnails, I guess it was because of the colour and the composition.  Well done and GL.', '2003-01-23 02:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(198354, 11301, 1829, '<td valign="top">I love that ''moment'' feel about your image.  My kids look like this also when they have just had a glass of milk.  Well done and GL.</td>', 'I love that ''moment'' feel about your image.  My kids look like this also when they have just had a glass of milk.  Well done and GL.', '2003-01-23 02:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(198355, 11301, 843, '<td valign="top">Cute. The floral patterns tend to blend together though.</td>', 'Cute. The floral patterns tend to blend together though.', '2003-01-23 02:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(198356, 11233, 843, '<td valign="top">You''ve seen Last Tango In Paris too many times LOL</td>', 'You''ve seen Last Tango In Paris too many times LOL', '2003-01-23 02:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(198359, 11216, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo of something that isn''t very interesting.... soggy cereal! Bleh. I really like the metallic sheen of the spoon against the ceramic bowl and the milk, and the lighting and focus are spot on, but the subect matter just doesn''t inspire me.</td>', 'This is a very nice photo of something that isn''t very interesting.... soggy cereal! Bleh. I really like the metallic sheen of the spoon against the ceramic bowl and the milk, and the lighting and focus are spot on, but the subect matter just doesn''t inspire me.', '2003-01-23 03:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198365, 11338, 1037, '<td valign="top">A plain but well shot setup photo. Interesting that there seem to be about 5 shadows behind that milk glass! The lighting could do with a bit more work, I think... more diffusion to make the shadows softer. I''m not a fan of a big, square crop either... it makes a photo difficult to read, in my opinion.</td>', 'A plain but well shot setup photo. Interesting that there seem to be about 5 shadows behind that milk glass! The lighting could do with a bit more work, I think... more diffusion to make the shadows softer. I''m not a fan of a big, square crop either... it makes a photo difficult to read, in my opinion.', '2003-01-23 03:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(198370, 11191, 1037, '<td valign="top">Strange and a bit grotesque! Is this the same bearded man who was in that tongue shot in the "Body Parts" challenge? If so, he''s a great subject for your photos... willing to do all kinds of things :). I like photos of people who look "real", and not classically photogenic.<br/> <br/>The milk splash effect is very well captured, but I think the lighting is too strong, making UFO shaped shadows on your background.</td>', 'Strange and a bit grotesque! Is this the same bearded man who was in that tongue shot in the "Body Parts" challenge? If so, he''s a great subject for your photos... willing to do all kinds of things :). I like photos of people who look "real", and not classically photogenic. The milk splash effect is very well captured, but I think the lighting is too strong, making UFO shaped shadows on your background.', '2003-01-23 03:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(198371, 11115, 1037, '<td valign="top">Arnit... I was at first kind of annoyed at the idea of such a famous photo being retaken for another challenge. But, I just looked back at "Got Toast", and read all those comments (I wasn''t here for that challenge), and I realised that having another chance to do this photo and have it taken for what it is, a great idea, without all the doubt about it being faked in photoshop, must be really satisfying for you! And this time, it shows even more flair. All that milk hanging in the air, with the snow on the ground and the beautiful clouds, makes this an amazing photo. So, I''m keeping an open mind and giving it 10 :).</td>', 'Arnit... I was at first kind of annoyed at the idea of such a famous photo being retaken for another challenge. But, I just looked back at "Got Toast", and read all those comments (I wasn''t here for that challenge), and I realised that having another chance to do this photo and have it taken for what it is, a great idea, without all the doubt about it being faked in photoshop, must be really satisfying for you! And this time, it shows even more flair. All that milk hanging in the air, with the snow on the ground and the beautiful clouds, makes this an amazing photo. So, I''m keeping an open mind and giving it 10 :).', '2003-01-23 03:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(198372, 11160, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice glass. I really enjoy the textures I can see here, and the camera angle is cool. The black background is nice too.  The DOF you used is interesting... not sure if it works or not. Actually, I think it does, because it pulls the eyes down to that cow print image on the glass. I have a feeling that I''d have liked some more negative space around the image... maybe above the glass? The tight frame just makes it a bit bland to me.</td>', 'Nice glass. I really enjoy the textures I can see here, and the camera angle is cool. The black background is nice too.  The DOF you used is interesting... not sure if it works or not. Actually, I think it does, because it pulls the eyes down to that cow print image on the glass. I have a feeling that I''d have liked some more negative space around the image... maybe above the glass? The tight frame just makes it a bit bland to me.', '2003-01-23 03:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(198373, 11242, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute in a kitsch, 1950s kind of way. It''s well shot. If I wasn''t a vegan I might find it appetising, but unfortunately all that cholesterol-ridden goo makes me shudder :P.</td>', 'Cute in a kitsch, 1950s kind of way. It''s well shot. If I wasn''t a vegan I might find it appetising, but unfortunately all that cholesterol-ridden goo makes me shudder :P.', '2003-01-23 03:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(198374, 11121, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute, but an almost square crop on a portrait doesn''t work well, compositionally. The background is also so close to the back of her head that the shadows of her hair interfere with the look of the photo by making it seem blurry around the edges.</td>', 'Cute, but an almost square crop on a portrait doesn''t work well, compositionally. The background is also so close to the back of her head that the shadows of her hair interfere with the look of the photo by making it seem blurry around the edges.', '2003-01-23 03:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(198375, 11171, 1037, '<td valign="top">I find this photo interesting and creative. It tells a little story, and uses visual elements that are composed in a slightly surreal way... chaotic but obviously arranged with a lot of thought. It''s hard to get a sense of perspective here, and the cat is motion blurred, but somehow I like it :).</td>', 'I find this photo interesting and creative. It tells a little story, and uses visual elements that are composed in a slightly surreal way... chaotic but obviously arranged with a lot of thought. It''s hard to get a sense of perspective here, and the cat is motion blurred, but somehow I like it :).', '2003-01-23 03:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(198376, 11205, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty porcelain, but the background is dull and the shot has little to keep my interest. With some better lighting and shallow DOF, this could be a more interesting shot (there are tutorials about these things on the site).</td>', 'Pretty porcelain, but the background is dull and the shot has little to keep my interest. With some better lighting and shallow DOF, this could be a more interesting shot (there are tutorials about these things on the site).', '2003-01-23 03:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198377, 11175, 1037, '<td valign="top">This seems scaled horizontally. It gives the cows a bizarre look. Other than that, they''re well composed and kind of appealing, compared to some other cow shots in this challenge.</td>', 'This seems scaled horizontally. It gives the cows a bizarre look. Other than that, they''re well composed and kind of appealing, compared to some other cow shots in this challenge.', '2003-01-23 03:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198378, 11074, 1037, '<td valign="top">Mmmm.... coffee. Everything about this shot is well done - the lighting, camera angle, composition, and the processing you did to get these colours. I like the grain, although I''m sure others have commented on it. I''m giving this 10.</td>', 'Mmmm.... coffee. Everything about this shot is well done - the lighting, camera angle, composition, and the processing you did to get these colours. I like the grain, although I''m sure others have commented on it. I''m giving this 10.', '2003-01-23 03:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(198379, 11053, 1037, '<td valign="top">A bit washed out (not enough tonal depth, try playing with the contrast or levels). Also slanted. Other than that, I actually think it''s an interesting, journalistic image capturing a slice of life. Those poor cows, up to their knees in mud and who knows what else! I''m glad I''m a vegan. High marks for the meaning in your photo.</td>', 'A bit washed out (not enough tonal depth, try playing with the contrast or levels). Also slanted. Other than that, I actually think it''s an interesting, journalistic image capturing a slice of life. Those poor cows, up to their knees in mud and who knows what else! I''m glad I''m a vegan. High marks for the meaning in your photo.', '2003-01-23 03:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(198380, 11177, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great focus and and I really like the angle although it looks unatural because of the lack of tilt of the milk.  The only real nit is the number of glares in the glass. It appears that you needed something to soften the lights i.e. a sheet or reflector. Good shot.</td>', 'Great focus and and I really like the angle although it looks unatural because of the lack of tilt of the milk.  The only real nit is the number of glares in the glass. It appears that you needed something to soften the lights i.e. a sheet or reflector. Good shot.', '2003-01-23 04:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(198381, 11072, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know what this is! Maybe the surface of a milkshake? It looks revolting, especially in this kind of washed out black and white, with such harsh lighting.</td>', 'I really don''t know what this is! Maybe the surface of a milkshake? It looks revolting, especially in this kind of washed out black and white, with such harsh lighting.', '2003-01-23 04:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(198382, 11316, 3280, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I have a problem with the milk, it is hard to rell it is there except for on the leaves and the red rose. A little too much white perhaps.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I have a problem with the milk, it is hard to rell it is there except for on the leaves and the red rose. A little too much white perhaps.', '2003-01-23 04:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198383, 11341, 3280, '<td valign="top">Mouse and the cheese, cute. I hope you cleaned it afterwards!  Lighting is a bit uneven, perhaps a bit too harsh between the lower right and the shadows. Good shot.</td>', 'Mouse and the cheese, cute. I hope you cleaned it afterwards!  Lighting is a bit uneven, perhaps a bit too harsh between the lower right and the shadows. Good shot.', '2003-01-23 04:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(198384, 11329, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, perhaps a brighter cereal would have given this more oomph.</td>', 'Nice shot, perhaps a brighter cereal would have given this more oomph.', '2003-01-23 04:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(198385, 11229, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool! It looks so ominous like this. Did you reverse the colours? I love it, very experimental and interesting.</td>', 'Cool! It looks so ominous like this. Did you reverse the colours? I love it, very experimental and interesting.', '2003-01-23 04:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(198386, 11115, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice knock off.  I really like his expression and the lighting on the model.  The biggest problem is not being able to see the bottom of what appears to be a glass in the top right.</td>', 'Nice knock off.  I really like his expression and the lighting on the model.  The biggest problem is not being able to see the bottom of what appears to be a glass in the top right.', '2003-01-23 04:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(198387, 11099, 1037, '<td valign="top">Oh, I see, it''s inside a fridge. Not a very interesting photo. Actually, there is one thing I like about it... the DOF you used makes that bottle in the back on the right really nice and soft. The composition is good in that it supports the idea in the photo and the title well.</td>', 'Oh, I see, it''s inside a fridge. Not a very interesting photo. Actually, there is one thing I like about it... the DOF you used makes that bottle in the back on the right really nice and soft. The composition is good in that it supports the idea in the photo and the title well.', '2003-01-23 04:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(198388, 11337, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, however it may have been better a little off center and with a black border.  It would also have been a lot sharper if you used more than the 66kb of the 150kb file size allowed.</td>', 'I like this a lot, however it may have been better a little off center and with a black border.  It would also have been a lot sharper if you used more than the 66kb of the 150kb file size allowed.', '2003-01-23 04:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(198389, 11162, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good splash althought the lighing is a bit uneven.  Use more file size and the strawberry would be much sharper. You only used half of the 150 kb allowed.</td>', 'Good splash althought the lighing is a bit uneven.  Use more file size and the strawberry would be much sharper. You only used half of the 150 kb allowed.', '2003-01-23 04:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(198390, 11200, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus and lighting.  I would have loved to see some of the butter melting down the sides of the corn. If it isn''t hot, you may have been able to drizzle some melted butter before shooting it.  Excellent shot.</td>', 'Very nice focus and lighting.  I would have loved to see some of the butter melting down the sides of the corn. If it isn''t hot, you may have been able to drizzle some melted butter before shooting it.  Excellent shot.', '2003-01-23 04:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(198391, 11076, 1037, '<td valign="top">The thing I like most about this photo is the surface you used... the little reflections in it are really nice.<br/> <br/>Other than that, the lighting is good, and the composition/camera angle/framing are pretty well done. It''s not a very interesting shot though.</td>', 'The thing I like most about this photo is the surface you used... the little reflections in it are really nice. Other than that, the lighting is good, and the composition/camera angle/framing are pretty well done. It''s not a very interesting shot though.', '2003-01-23 04:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(198392, 11189, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good color, although a bit busy.  A bit of a stretch for the challenge as well.</td>', 'Good color, although a bit busy.  A bit of a stretch for the challenge as well.', '2003-01-23 04:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(198393, 11268, 3280, '<td valign="top">Looks good, yummy.  Focus seems just a bit soft.  A little powdered chocolate or cinamon on top might have really given it some oomph.</td>', 'Looks good, yummy.  Focus seems just a bit soft.  A little powdered chocolate or cinamon on top might have really given it some oomph.', '2003-01-23 04:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(198394, 11189, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a very interesting photo, but doesn''t fit the challenge in any obvious way other than by relying on the title. Is it one of those Japanese game shows where they torture each other in strange ways? Very weird and interesting, just not about milk.</td>', 'I think it''s a very interesting photo, but doesn''t fit the challenge in any obvious way other than by relying on the title. Is it one of those Japanese game shows where they torture each other in strange ways? Very weird and interesting, just not about milk.', '2003-01-23 04:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(198395, 11072, 3280, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I am really having a hard time telling what this is.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I am really having a hard time telling what this is.', '2003-01-23 04:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(198396, 11162, 1037, '<td valign="top">Good splash shot. The burst of red colouring against the milk is lovely, and the shadows work well to define the splash against the background. Nice compostion.</td>', 'Good splash shot. The burst of red colouring against the milk is lovely, and the shadows work well to define the splash against the background. Nice compostion.', '2003-01-23 04:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(198397, 11076, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and color.  Only real improvement is that I might have liked the "chocolate" milk a little darker. I like the light reflections in front of the three glasses.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice composition and color.  Only real improvement is that I might have liked the "chocolate" milk a little darker. I like the light reflections in front of the three glasses.  Good job.', '2003-01-23 04:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198398, 11080, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good job, perhaps a bit too much glare on the milk.  The cookie seems a little too yellow on my monitor as well.</td>', 'Good job, perhaps a bit too much glare on the milk.  The cookie seems a little too yellow on my monitor as well.', '2003-01-23 04:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(198399, 11191, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wild shot! I sure hope this is milk and not paint!!  Good composition and stop action. I''m not sure how refreshing it would be.  Good take and creativity on the challenge.</td>', 'Wild shot! I sure hope this is milk and not paint!!  Good composition and stop action. I''m not sure how refreshing it would be.  Good take and creativity on the challenge.', '2003-01-23 04:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(198400, 11336, 3280, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting.  I wish that the milk container didn''t appear already opened. Focus on the needle is a bit soft as well.</td>', 'I really like the lighting.  I wish that the milk container didn''t appear already opened. Focus on the needle is a bit soft as well.', '2003-01-23 04:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198401, 11338, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot although this may have worked better on a different background.  A little darker one would have shown the milk better and appeared less grainy.</td>', 'Nice shot although this may have worked better on a different background.  A little darker one would have shown the milk better and appeared less grainy.', '2003-01-23 04:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(198402, 11202, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really great!  One of my favorites this week.  I love the swiss cheese and the shadow of the glass.  Excellent!</td>', 'Really great!  One of my favorites this week.  I love the swiss cheese and the shadow of the glass.  Excellent!', '2003-01-23 04:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(198403, 11121, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very cute and it appears to be the only milk mustache entered. Probably should have used something a little thicker than milk though like whipped cream or even shaving cream to stand out though.  Good job.</td>', 'Very cute and it appears to be the only milk mustache entered. Probably should have used something a little thicker than milk though like whipped cream or even shaving cream to stand out though.  Good job.', '2003-01-23 04:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(198404, 11284, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job, I really like the flying milk and the background.  I wonder how it would look a little more off-center?</td>', 'Nice job, I really like the flying milk and the background.  I wonder how it would look a little more off-center?', '2003-01-23 04:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198405, 11236, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I think a little more file size of the 150 kb allowed would have really helped here.  A dark border may have set it off as well.  Good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I think a little more file size of the 150 kb allowed would have really helped here.  A dark border may have set it off as well.  Good take on the challenge.', '2003-01-23 05:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(198406, 11233, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I''m sure you''ve already heard it but the model is a little too red and a little soft on focus.</td>', 'Nice idea. I''m sure you''ve already heard it but the model is a little too red and a little soft on focus.', '2003-01-23 05:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(198407, 11074, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composition.  It just seems really grainy though. Is the light level a little too low? Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Good idea and composition.  It just seems really grainy though. Is the light level a little too low? Nice take on the challenge.', '2003-01-23 05:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(198408, 11168, 3280, '<td valign="top">Humerous, it sure looks cold. Nice shot.</td>', 'Humerous, it sure looks cold. Nice shot.', '2003-01-23 05:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(198409, 11288, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a little overexposed and a little soft on the focus.  Could have been sharper by using more of the 150 kb file size allowed.  I would use a darker border as well.</td>', 'Nice shot but a little overexposed and a little soft on the focus.  Could have been sharper by using more of the 150 kb file size allowed.  I would use a darker border as well.', '2003-01-23 05:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(198410, 11079, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good job, although I would rather the bowl wasn''t there.  I assume this wasn''t a fun shot to take as the "model" probably didn''t listen to directions well!</td>', 'Good job, although I would rather the bowl wasn''t there.  I assume this wasn''t a fun shot to take as the "model" probably didn''t listen to directions well!', '2003-01-23 05:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
