(198412, 11211, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, one of my faves this week. The lighting is fantastic, I would like to see your set-up.  Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, one of my faves this week. The lighting is fantastic, I would like to see your set-up.  Great job.', '2003-01-23 05:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(198429, 11233, 3585, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what his expression realy means in english. In french, to be buttered, is to be perfectly out of control drunk. In the case of this person, it looks like a serious magenta overdose.</td>', 'I don''t know what his expression realy means in english. In french, to be buttered, is to be perfectly out of control drunk. In the case of this person, it looks like a serious magenta overdose.', '2003-01-23 06:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(198437, 11140, 885, '<td valign="top">Cool, it kinda looks like one frosted cheerio in a field of regular  ones.  The only thing I could wish for would be maybe seeing the second drop coming down (maybe would have been easier in a vertical format).</td>', 'Cool, it kinda looks like one frosted cheerio in a field of regular  ones.  The only thing I could wish for would be maybe seeing the second drop coming down (maybe would have been easier in a vertical format).', '2003-01-23 07:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(198438, 11329, 885, '<td valign="top">Your cropping, angle, and color balance seem a bit strange to me (at least on this monitor) the cheerios look almost reddish.  The edges of the bowl seem a bit arbitrarily cropped, and I think it could have been improved with a bit less centered composition.</td>', 'Your cropping, angle, and color balance seem a bit strange to me (at least on this monitor) the cheerios look almost reddish.  The edges of the bowl seem a bit arbitrarily cropped, and I think it could have been improved with a bit less centered composition.', '2003-01-23 07:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(198439, 11157, 885, '<td valign="top">Cool.  It looks really surreal and moon-like to me.  I don''t quite understand why that edge is black without being able to see the edge of the cup, but I like it.</td>', 'Cool.  It looks really surreal and moon-like to me.  I don''t quite understand why that edge is black without being able to see the edge of the cup, but I like it.', '2003-01-23 07:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(198441, 11160, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.  You might have tried B&amp;W for this since the colors are so so few.  I like how the glass seems to almost be glowing.  Probably could have been improved if the rim of the cup was in focus a bit more.  Not that I''m the DoF police or anything though...:)</td>', 'Interesting angle.  You might have tried B&W for this since the colors are so so few.  I like how the glass seems to almost be glowing.  Probably could have been improved if the rim of the cup was in focus a bit more.  Not that I''m the DoF police or anything though...:)', '2003-01-23 07:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(198492, 11154, 5044, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better with a different coloured background. It is very hard to see the milk in this shot. Other than that, it is a good shot. Focus is sharp and you captures the milk just in time. Nice job.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better with a different coloured background. It is very hard to see the milk in this shot. Other than that, it is a good shot. Focus is sharp and you captures the milk just in time. Nice job.', '2003-01-23 08:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(198496, 11288, 5044, '<td valign="top">Somehow the colours on that cheese don''t seem right. Maybe a little more saturation would have brought out the orange in the cheese and made more contrast against the crackers. Good DOF. Nice sharpness.</td>', 'Somehow the colours on that cheese don''t seem right. Maybe a little more saturation would have brought out the orange in the cheese and made more contrast against the crackers. Good DOF. Nice sharpness.', '2003-01-23 08:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(198498, 11191, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great capture. It looks like he''s wearing a HAT. Nice job.</td>', 'Great capture. It looks like he''s wearing a HAT. Nice job.', '2003-01-23 08:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(198500, 11112, 5044, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the white on white. Maybe on chocolate milk would have made the flower stand out more. The focus is a little "soft" for my taste, but still it is very nice. Good job.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the white on white. Maybe on chocolate milk would have made the flower stand out more. The focus is a little "soft" for my taste, but still it is very nice. Good job.', '2003-01-23 08:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(198503, 11208, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Could this be Jacko? Or maybe just somebody inspired by him. Nice job whoever you are.</td>', 'Great shot. Could this be Jacko? Or maybe just somebody inspired by him. Nice job whoever you are.', '2003-01-23 08:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(198532, 11316, 1037, '<td valign="top">The way the white rose blends into the milk is interesting, but the roses look a bit too soggy for my liking. I don''t like the way the milk makes them droop and glisten in the light. Nice composition and lighting though.</td>', 'The way the white rose blends into the milk is interesting, but the roses look a bit too soggy for my liking. I don''t like the way the milk makes them droop and glisten in the light. Nice composition and lighting though.', '2003-01-23 09:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(198533, 11157, 1037, '<td valign="top">A little bit uninspiring compared to some of the other splash shots. There isn''t much tonal depth, and the composition is a bit loose. A tighter crop might have been better.</td>', 'A little bit uninspiring compared to some of the other splash shots. There isn''t much tonal depth, and the composition is a bit loose. A tighter crop might have been better.', '2003-01-23 09:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(198535, 11284, 1037, '<td valign="top">The shape of this splash is interesting, but the lighting is too harsh. The dark shadow cast on the background undermines the photo. If it was just white against blue, it would have been nicer.</td>', 'The shape of this splash is interesting, but the lighting is too harsh. The dark shadow cast on the background undermines the photo. If it was just white against blue, it would have been nicer.', '2003-01-23 09:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(198539, 11321, 1037, '<td valign="top">Awesome shallow DOF and beautiful black and white. I''m giving this a 10!</td>', 'Awesome shallow DOF and beautiful black and white. I''m giving this a 10!', '2003-01-23 09:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(198540, 11204, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, this just says "lavish" to me. So many beautiful tones and textures in this photo. Maybe it''s a little bit busy, but it has a great sense of atmosphere. Good work.</td>', 'Wow, this just says "lavish" to me. So many beautiful tones and textures in this photo. Maybe it''s a little bit busy, but it has a great sense of atmosphere. Good work.', '2003-01-23 09:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(198541, 11288, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting tones... not much depth, but that kind of works here. I think the bright yellow border undermines the subtelty of the colours in the photo. The lighting and composition are good.</td>', 'Interesting tones... not much depth, but that kind of works here. I think the bright yellow border undermines the subtelty of the colours in the photo. The lighting and composition are good.', '2003-01-23 09:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(198543, 11227, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hrrm... funny in a tasteless way (I like crude humour, but this isn''t crude enough :P). The lighting is bad, the photo is underexposed and it''s washed out (you could have increased the contrast a bit).</td>', 'Hrrm... funny in a tasteless way (I like crude humour, but this isn''t crude enough :P). The lighting is bad, the photo is underexposed and it''s washed out (you could have increased the contrast a bit).', '2003-01-23 09:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(198544, 11336, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think I get it... you''re injecting cream into an orange to make calcium fortified orange juice? It''s not a photo that appeals to me much, but I think you achieved what you set out to. The technical qualities of the photo are quite good.</td>', 'I think I get it... you''re injecting cream into an orange to make calcium fortified orange juice? It''s not a photo that appeals to me much, but I think you achieved what you set out to. The technical qualities of the photo are quite good.', '2003-01-23 09:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(198546, 11112, 1037, '<td valign="top">Glorious study in white! This was a great way to work a flower shot into a milk challenge :P. I can''t fault it technically, I think it''s beautiful. The composition, especially, is very strong.</td>', 'Glorious study in white! This was a great way to work a flower shot into a milk challenge :P. I can''t fault it technically, I think it''s beautiful. The composition, especially, is very strong.', '2003-01-23 10:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(198548, 11301, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty. This is well photographed. I find the patterns on the sofa and the clothing to be a bit busy though.</td>', 'Pretty. This is well photographed. I find the patterns on the sofa and the clothing to be a bit busy though.', '2003-01-23 10:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198550, 11140, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like your shallow DOF here, along with having a quick enough shutter speed to get the milk splash effect. This is a very good technical achievement.</td>', 'I really like your shallow DOF here, along with having a quick enough shutter speed to get the milk splash effect. This is a very good technical achievement.', '2003-01-23 10:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(198551, 11177, 1037, '<td valign="top">Good composition. There are a lot of milk and cookie photos in this challenge, but yours is more on the level of art than many of them.</td>', 'Good composition. There are a lot of milk and cookie photos in this challenge, but yours is more on the level of art than many of them.', '2003-01-23 10:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(198552, 11307, 1037, '<td valign="top">I guess this is a cute idea, but it''s kinda gross :P. The lighting is a tad strong and uneven, casting dark shadows on the side of the child''s face. I like the cropping though.</td>', 'I guess this is a cute idea, but it''s kinda gross :P. The lighting is a tad strong and uneven, casting dark shadows on the side of the child''s face. I like the cropping though.', '2003-01-23 10:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198553, 11208, 1037, '<td valign="top">A pretty neat splash shot. Good, strong composition.</td>', 'A pretty neat splash shot. Good, strong composition.', '2003-01-23 10:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(198581, 11168, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Great use of the rule of 3rds.  good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Great use of the rule of 3rds.  good luck.', '2003-01-23 10:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(198582, 11140, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice dof.  great lighting.  good luck</td>', 'Nice dof.  great lighting.  good luck', '2003-01-23 11:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(198583, 11336, 714, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  The lighting is perfect.  Good luck</td>', 'Very creative.  The lighting is perfect.  Good luck', '2003-01-23 11:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(198584, 11152, 714, '<td valign="top">How cute!  The lighting is not as good as I would like, but I guess you couldn''t help that.  Maybe if you lowered yourself and then took the picture.  Good luck</td>', 'How cute!  The lighting is not as good as I would like, but I guess you couldn''t help that.  Maybe if you lowered yourself and then took the picture.  Good luck', '2003-01-23 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(198585, 11205, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, makes me want to head upstairs and grab a cup of coffee with some chocolate in it.  Very good focus.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice shot, makes me want to head upstairs and grab a cup of coffee with some chocolate in it.  Very good focus.  Good luck!', '2003-01-23 11:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(198588, 11242, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yummy. Did you eat that after you took the photo?</td>', 'Yummy. Did you eat that after you took the photo?', '2003-01-23 11:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(198589, 11316, 714, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like this.  I mean the roses in milk.  The picture is well taken.  The lighting on the white rose is a little harsh.  Am I missing something here. I just don''t get it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really don''t like this.  I mean the roses in milk.  The picture is well taken.  The lighting on the white rose is a little harsh.  Am I missing something here. I just don''t get it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-23 11:07:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(198590, 11208, 714, '<td valign="top">That must be a mini oreo.  Very nicely exsicuted.  Good luck.</td>', 'That must be a mini oreo.  Very nicely exsicuted.  Good luck.', '2003-01-23 11:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198592, 11157, 714, '<td valign="top">Different.  Not sure if I like the black in the background.  good luck</td>', 'Different.  Not sure if I like the black in the background.  good luck', '2003-01-23 11:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(198594, 11187, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Perfect in my eyes.  Love the way you have the empty one in front of the full ones.  good luck.</td>', 'Great shot.  Perfect in my eyes.  Love the way you have the empty one in front of the full ones.  good luck.', '2003-01-23 11:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(198597, 11305, 714, '<td valign="top">A good way of getting the seem out of the papers meeting is to bend your posterboard and put the glass on top of it so you don''t see any seem.  The light seems to do good at reflecting to.</td>', 'A good way of getting the seem out of the papers meeting is to bend your posterboard and put the glass on top of it so you don''t see any seem.  The light seems to do good at reflecting to.', '2003-01-23 11:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(198598, 11074, 714, '<td valign="top">I like the hint of blue here.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the hint of blue here.  Nice shot.', '2003-01-23 11:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(198599, 11329, 714, '<td valign="top">The lighting is to dark.  The mild looks more yellow then white.  Try chaning your white settings to indoors.  That might help.</td>', 'The lighting is to dark.  The mild looks more yellow then white.  Try chaning your white settings to indoors.  That might help.', '2003-01-23 11:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(198600, 11072, 714, '<td valign="top"><br/></td>', '', '2003-01-23 11:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(198602, 11341, 714, '<td valign="top">This is good.  I normally wouldn''t have liked the lighting, but I think your wanting to create a story here.  Very creative and great work.</td>', 'This is good.  I normally wouldn''t have liked the lighting, but I think your wanting to create a story here.  Very creative and great work.', '2003-01-23 11:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(198603, 11211, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I especially like the way you framed it.  Good coloring and lighting.  Good luck</td>', 'Nice shot, I especially like the way you framed it.  Good coloring and lighting.  Good luck', '2003-01-23 11:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(198604, 11200, 714, '<td valign="top">Yummmmmm!  I like it.  Great lighting and framing.</td>', 'Yummmmmm!  I like it.  Great lighting and framing.', '2003-01-23 11:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(198605, 11202, 714, '<td valign="top">Cool shadow.  Very creative.  Good luck</td>', 'Cool shadow.  Very creative.  Good luck', '2003-01-23 11:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(198606, 11229, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow very creative.  Makes me think of milk.  Nice color and the lighting is great.</td>', 'Wow very creative.  Makes me think of milk.  Nice color and the lighting is great.', '2003-01-23 11:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(198608, 11288, 714, '<td valign="top">Try changing your f-stop in your camera to get the whole shot in focus.</td>', 'Try changing your f-stop in your camera to get the whole shot in focus.', '2003-01-23 11:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(198609, 11099, 714, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the top is distracting.  I do like your idea.</td>', 'The reflection on the top is distracting.  I do like your idea.', '2003-01-23 11:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(198610, 11282, 714, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it more if I could see some yorgort on the foil.  Very simply shot.  Background seems like it has a pink tint to it, but I like it.</td>', 'I would have liked it more if I could see some yorgort on the foil.  Very simply shot.  Background seems like it has a pink tint to it, but I like it.', '2003-01-23 11:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198611, 11082, 714, '<td valign="top">It is tilted, to fix it you could have put a border on it and the turned the picture slightly.  good luck</td>', 'It is tilted, to fix it you could have put a border on it and the turned the picture slightly.  good luck', '2003-01-23 11:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198613, 11242, 714, '<td valign="top">I don''t care fo the background.</td>', 'I don''t care fo the background.', '2003-01-23 11:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(198614, 11162, 714, '<td valign="top">Love the border and the dark color of the strawberry.  good luck.</td>', 'Love the border and the dark color of the strawberry.  good luck.', '2003-01-23 11:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(198615, 11204, 714, '<td valign="top">Yuck!! I do like the shot.  Great lighting and you have some nice rich colors.  I just don''t like mold on my cheese. I will however take a slice of that bread.  :-)</td>', 'Yuck!! I do like the shot.  Great lighting and you have some nice rich colors.  I just don''t like mold on my cheese. I will however take a slice of that bread.  :-)', '2003-01-23 11:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(198619, 11321, 2983, '<td valign="top">Got a million and a half "needs more DOF" comments yet?  This photo is perfect the way it is, the limited DOF adds a sense of depth to the image.</td>', 'Got a million and a half "needs more DOF" comments yet?  This photo is perfect the way it is, the limited DOF adds a sense of depth to the image.', '2003-01-23 11:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(198622, 11310, 1037, '<td valign="top">The composition of this photo is quite awkward, with that middle block lining up with the one in its wrapper. The background is very intrusive with all th ripples of fabric. The lighting is a bit dim over the chocolate itself, like it''s in shadow.</td>', 'The composition of this photo is quite awkward, with that middle block lining up with the one in its wrapper. The background is very intrusive with all th ripples of fabric. The lighting is a bit dim over the chocolate itself, like it''s in shadow.', '2003-01-23 11:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(198624, 11327, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp shot of this, with even lighting. I don''t really know what else to comment on, though. It''s really a photo of an artwork.</td>', 'Nice, crisp shot of this, with even lighting. I don''t really know what else to comment on, though. It''s really a photo of an artwork.', '2003-01-23 11:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(198627, 11154, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the motion blur here, but it''s a bit inidistinct against a white background. The comosition is also a bit awkward, it''s not centred but it''s not far from the centre. The cereal has some nice textures and colours though.</td>', 'I like the motion blur here, but it''s a bit inidistinct against a white background. The comosition is also a bit awkward, it''s not centred but it''s not far from the centre. The cereal has some nice textures and colours though.', '2003-01-23 11:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(198630, 11152, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting... something I rarely see. The angle you got is good, the composition is fine, and the exposure is even, showing all the details, dim but lit OK. It''s a difficult photo to like though!</td>', 'Interesting... something I rarely see. The angle you got is good, the composition is fine, and the exposure is even, showing all the details, dim but lit OK. It''s a difficult photo to like though!', '2003-01-23 11:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(198633, 11211, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty! I love what you achieved with the lighting here, and the effect of that textured, metallic gold surface. One of the better artistic achievements in this challenge.</td>', 'Pretty! I love what you achieved with the lighting here, and the effect of that textured, metallic gold surface. One of the better artistic achievements in this challenge.', '2003-01-23 11:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198634, 11337, 6251, '<td valign="top">Great simple design</td>', 'Great simple design', '2003-01-23 11:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(198643, 11079, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute... but it seems kind of low res and jaggy, with harsh lighting on the whiskers. But I really like the composition of this. It''s a very appealing photo.</td>', 'Cute... but it seems kind of low res and jaggy, with harsh lighting on the whiskers. But I really like the composition of this. It''s a very appealing photo.', '2003-01-23 11:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(198651, 11268, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is very pleasant. I like the curly patterns in the cream and the chocolatey froth around the outside. The cropping is maybe a tiny bit too close. The shallow DOF is great, bringing the focus to the upper mound of cream. Nice work.</td>', 'This is very pleasant. I like the curly patterns in the cream and the chocolatey froth around the outside. The cropping is maybe a tiny bit too close. The shallow DOF is great, bringing the focus to the upper mound of cream. Nice work.', '2003-01-23 12:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(198656, 11305, 1037, '<td valign="top">The composition of this is OK, and the lighting is nice. I don''t like the seam in the background. The subject matter is a bit uninspiring. Some other milk and cookies photos in this challenge have really grabbed me because they do something different with composition, etc.</td>', 'The composition of this is OK, and the lighting is nice. I don''t like the seam in the background. The subject matter is a bit uninspiring. Some other milk and cookies photos in this challenge have really grabbed me because they do something different with composition, etc.', '2003-01-23 12:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(198661, 11080, 1037, '<td valign="top">As much as I dislike dairy products, this is a very appetising photo :). Lovely, simple compsition, nice colours, and a background with a lovely gradient.</td>', 'As much as I dislike dairy products, this is a very appetising photo :). Lovely, simple compsition, nice colours, and a background with a lovely gradient.', '2003-01-23 12:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(198664, 11322, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute :). Very colourful and simply composed. Nice work.</td>', 'Cute :). Very colourful and simply composed. Nice work.', '2003-01-23 12:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198666, 11204, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nice display -- looks right out of a magazine!</td>', 'Very nice display -- looks right out of a magazine!', '2003-01-23 12:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(198667, 11282, 1037, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite tell what I''m looking at here! As an abstract it''s kind of nice. The shapes are interesting, and the colour is vivid. Looking at it as a splash of interesting colour against white space, it''s an appealing photo.</td>', 'I can''t quite tell what I''m looking at here! As an abstract it''s kind of nice. The shapes are interesting, and the colour is vivid. Looking at it as a splash of interesting colour against white space, it''s an appealing photo.', '2003-01-23 12:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(198668, 11200, 3102, '<td valign="top">My 4-year-old daughter is telling me how much better corn is when it has that much butter on it.  You''ve moved her!  Very nice shot -- we''re both looking forward to getting some fresh corn now :)</td>', 'My 4-year-old daughter is telling me how much better corn is when it has that much butter on it.  You''ve moved her!  Very nice shot -- we''re both looking forward to getting some fresh corn now :)', '2003-01-23 12:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(198669, 11242, 3102, '<td valign="top">Clever name, and a nice shot!  Now I''m hungry.</td>', 'Clever name, and a nice shot!  Now I''m hungry.', '2003-01-23 12:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(198671, 11341, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. The lighting gives a feeling of drama that matches with the title. The composition is nice.</td>', 'Cute idea. The lighting gives a feeling of drama that matches with the title. The composition is nice.', '2003-01-23 12:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(198672, 11076, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well done!  I was almost ready to say that the shot was a bit grainy, and then I realized that my monitor is dusty!  The black seemed to enhance the dust!  Anyway, I like the shot a lot -- the reflections on the table surface create an interesting blend of colors, too.</td>', 'Well done!  I was almost ready to say that the shot was a bit grainy, and then I realized that my monitor is dusty!  The black seemed to enhance the dust!  Anyway, I like the shot a lot -- the reflections on the table surface create an interesting blend of colors, too.', '2003-01-23 12:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(198673, 11202, 3102, '<td valign="top">I may have liked it better without the shadow, but it''s still an excellent shot.</td>', 'I may have liked it better without the shadow, but it''s still an excellent shot.', '2003-01-23 12:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(198674, 11175, 3102, '<td valign="top">Moo, and moo!  Nice shot -- cows always have such interesting, ticked-off looking expressions.</td>', 'Moo, and moo!  Nice shot -- cows always have such interesting, ticked-off looking expressions.', '2003-01-23 12:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(198711, 11299, 3102, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it meets the challenge.  Ha!  Just kidding.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'I don''t think it meets the challenge.  Ha!  Just kidding.  Nicely composed.', '2003-01-23 13:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(198712, 11191, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s quite a sacrifice for the sake of the challenge!  Funny shot -- hopefully you didn''t need too many re-shoots!</td>', 'Well, that''s quite a sacrifice for the sake of the challenge!  Funny shot -- hopefully you didn''t need too many re-shoots!', '2003-01-23 13:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(198718, 11229, 2983, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail, the lighting works will with the scratches.  So, do you use this to grate solid granite, or what?</td>', 'Very nice detail, the lighting works will with the scratches.  So, do you use this to grate solid granite, or what?', '2003-01-23 13:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(198729, 11082, 1037, '<td valign="top">Culturally very interesting! Asian cultures don''t eat much dairy. The colours are bright and the photo is crisp, but that slight tilt is distracting.</td>', 'Culturally very interesting! Asian cultures don''t eat much dairy. The colours are bright and the photo is crisp, but that slight tilt is distracting.', '2003-01-23 14:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198734, 11236, 1037, '<td valign="top">Yay! Soy milk! We don''t have that brand in Australia, but when my boyfriend and I were in the US last year we drank it all the time, and it''s heavenly!<br/> <br/>I love the way you lit the soy milk to make it seem really important, almost angelic :). But the elements in this photo are a bit disconnected from one another compositionally. Some more overlap would make them compete less for attention.</td>', 'Yay! Soy milk! We don''t have that brand in Australia, but when my boyfriend and I were in the US last year we drank it all the time, and it''s heavenly! I love the way you lit the soy milk to make it seem really important, almost angelic :). But the elements in this photo are a bit disconnected from one another compositionally. Some more overlap would make them compete less for attention.', '2003-01-23 14:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(198735, 11113, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours and nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours and nice composition and lighting.', '2003-01-23 14:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198736, 11233, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hrrm.... strange colours. Looks like you used the flash, which is a nono for portraits. The expression on the woman''s face seems to match the title perfectly though :).</td>', 'Hrrm.... strange colours. Looks like you used the flash, which is a nono for portraits. The expression on the woman''s face seems to match the title perfectly though :).', '2003-01-23 14:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(198737, 11299, 1037, '<td valign="top">The photo is nicely framed, and the soft, dusky (or dawn?) light is really nice. But it''s a bit of a dull image.</td>', 'The photo is nicely framed, and the soft, dusky (or dawn?) light is really nice. But it''s a bit of a dull image.', '2003-01-23 14:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
