(198753, 11233, 4648, '<td valign="top">I really like the very cute idea.  But what happened to your color.  Too much blue.  Fixing the colors or adjusting the hues will fix that.  Shame too, because the rest of the photo is really good; composition, focus, crop, meeting challenge.  But still it''s a 5.</td>', 'I really like the very cute idea.  But what happened to your color.  Too much blue.  Fixing the colors or adjusting the hues will fix that.  Shame too, because the rest of the photo is really good; composition, focus, crop, meeting challenge.  But still it''s a 5.', '2003-01-23 14:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
