(198935, 11202, 4055, '<td valign="top">The shot is very well taken. Good lighting and focus. The background and the shadows are perfect. Interesting composition. You know, I´m a VERY big fan of borders but I think this yellow one steals too much attention from the motiv. Perhaps a white one had been better? Anyway a great job and that gives high score from me.</td>', 'The shot is very well taken. Good lighting and focus. The background and the shadows are perfect. Interesting composition. You know, I´m a VERY big fan of borders but I think this yellow one steals too much attention from the motiv. Perhaps a white one had been better? Anyway a great job and that gives high score from me.', '2003-01-23 18:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
