(199376, 11113, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice color on the Strawberries and composition.  I wish the ice cream showed up a bit better.  A border may have helped this shot by bringing out the ice cream some.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice color on the Strawberries and composition.  I wish the ice cream showed up a bit better.  A border may have helped this shot by bringing out the ice cream some.  Good job.', '2003-01-24 13:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(199377, 11238, 3280, '<td valign="top">I''m having a little bit of a hard time understanding this one. I''m not sure is this is the bottom of a bottle or what. Sorry!</td>', 'I''m having a little bit of a hard time understanding this one. I''m not sure is this is the bottom of a bottle or what. Sorry!', '2003-01-24 13:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(199379, 11112, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  I like the gracefullness and failty of the flower.  The drops of milk on the petals is essential.  I''m not positive that Black and White was the answer here and I really like B &amp; W.  I would really liket to see the colors on the stamen of the flower against the petals and milk.  Good job.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  I like the gracefullness and failty of the flower.  The drops of milk on the petals is essential.  I''m not positive that Black and White was the answer here and I really like B & W.  I would really liket to see the colors on the stamen of the flower against the petals and milk.  Good job.', '2003-01-24 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(199380, 11171, 3280, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Very creative, although I''m not sure that the cat adds anything here and actually may take away from the rest of the shot.  I think I would like to see the glass where the cat is pouring down toward the girl.  Good job.</td>', 'Interesting concept. Very creative, although I''m not sure that the cat adds anything here and actually may take away from the rest of the shot.  I think I would like to see the glass where the cat is pouring down toward the girl.  Good job.', '2003-01-24 13:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(199383, 11157, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think that using the more of the 150 kb file size allowed may have helped this shot.  I''m not positive the black and white was the answer either with the milk aready being so white.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think that using the more of the 150 kb file size allowed may have helped this shot.  I''m not positive the black and white was the answer either with the milk aready being so white.', '2003-01-24 13:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(199384, 11152, 3280, '<td valign="top">Creative shot. I think that using the more of the 150 kb file size allowed may have helped this shot. I would have liked to see a bit more color saturation as well.</td>', 'Creative shot. I think that using the more of the 150 kb file size allowed may have helped this shot. I would have liked to see a bit more color saturation as well.', '2003-01-24 13:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(199385, 11204, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really nice job.  I love the composition and creativity of this shot.  It seems like it could have been just a bit brighter though especially on the cheese.  I really like the textures here.  Excellent.</td>', 'Really nice job.  I love the composition and creativity of this shot.  It seems like it could have been just a bit brighter though especially on the cheese.  I really like the textures here.  Excellent.', '2003-01-24 13:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
