(199389, 11082, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job, good color and composition.  A couple of minor problems...the glare on the top left and the table is not horizontal.</td>', 'Nice job, good color and composition.  A couple of minor problems...the glare on the top left and the table is not horizontal.', '2003-01-24 13:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
