(199553, 11233, 4162, '<td valign="top">Just wondering what your white balance was set to, cause of the colour cast in this, I got this blue cast when the flash was on but the white balance was set to incandescent lighting.</td>', 'Just wondering what your white balance was set to, cause of the colour cast in this, I got this blue cast when the flash was on but the white balance was set to incandescent lighting.', '2003-01-24 18:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
