(199559, 11204, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful, what a great still life.  Very rustic and lovely colours, textures and makes me sooo hungry! Good Luck! My favourite this week, came back for another look, would make a lovely kitchen picture, framed on the wall.</td>', 'This is very beautiful, what a great still life.  Very rustic and lovely colours, textures and makes me sooo hungry! Good Luck! My favourite this week, came back for another look, would make a lovely kitchen picture, framed on the wall.', '2003-01-24 18:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
