(199770, 11080, 3294, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this.  But the milk looks watered down... skim?  I used whipping cream on my photo because it''s much thicker and whiter than plain ol'' milk.  Now I''m hungry for a cookie.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this.  But the milk looks watered down... skim?  I used whipping cream on my photo because it''s much thicker and whiter than plain ol'' milk.  Now I''m hungry for a cookie.', '2003-01-25 06:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(199771, 11341, 3294, '<td valign="top">How creative!  Cool mouse too.  I like the texture of the shredded cheese, but I think if I were to change something I would have not used this mouse but a solid colored one.  So that it matches the cheese.  Clever photo!</td>', 'How creative!  Cool mouse too.  I like the texture of the shredded cheese, but I think if I were to change something I would have not used this mouse but a solid colored one.  So that it matches the cheese.  Clever photo!', '2003-01-25 06:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(199772, 11307, 3294, '<td valign="top">Funny, but in a gross way.  Might be a different reaction if it were his hands with a fistful of cheese ABOUT to take a bite... kinda like anticipating his muching?  Dunno.</td>', 'Funny, but in a gross way.  Might be a different reaction if it were his hands with a fistful of cheese ABOUT to take a bite... kinda like anticipating his muching?  Dunno.', '2003-01-25 06:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
