(199774, 11191, 3294, '<td valign="top">I hope you wamed the milk first, huh?  I''m sorry but this photo is unappealing to me.  It has everything with his his reaction. I expect he should be laughing or shocked.. but he looks almost bored with it.  How many takes did he have to endure exactly?!  Haha! If I could change something it would be to somehow lose the shadows on the cieling (it looks like).  Maybe by opening up the aperture to blur them out?  Dunno.  Good luck!</td>', 'I hope you wamed the milk first, huh?  I''m sorry but this photo is unappealing to me.  It has everything with his his reaction. I expect he should be laughing or shocked.. but he looks almost bored with it.  How many takes did he have to endure exactly?!  Haha! If I could change something it would be to somehow lose the shadows on the cieling (it looks like).  Maybe by opening up the aperture to blur them out?  Dunno.  Good luck!', '2003-01-25 06:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(199776, 11227, 3294, '<td valign="top">Not sure what these are but it''s funny.  Is it broken or chopped off on the bottom left there?  Everything seesm so dark too... this could be effective as a b/w maybe?  Good luck!</td>', 'Not sure what these are but it''s funny.  Is it broken or chopped off on the bottom left there?  Everything seesm so dark too... this could be effective as a b/w maybe?  Good luck!', '2003-01-25 06:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(199777, 11099, 3294, '<td valign="top">I just realized that it''s a bag of cheese!  This looks like my fridge, which is the funny part.</td>', 'I just realized that it''s a bag of cheese!  This looks like my fridge, which is the funny part.', '2003-01-25 06:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(199779, 11288, 3294, '<td valign="top">Honestly, the border just overpowers the photo.  Way to bright for me.  But the photo is nice... and looks totally yummy.  Cropping seems a little tight at the top near the crackers and the focus appears to be soft although it''s hard to say because the cheese has such a unique texture.  This could even be a neat study in textures... the cheese and crackers.</td>', 'Honestly, the border just overpowers the photo.  Way to bright for me.  But the photo is nice... and looks totally yummy.  Cropping seems a little tight at the top near the crackers and the focus appears to be soft although it''s hard to say because the cheese has such a unique texture.  This could even be a neat study in textures... the cheese and crackers.', '2003-01-25 06:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(199780, 11157, 3294, '<td valign="top">I''m totally no one used a colored milk for one of these shots... like strawberry milk to change it up some.  Or how about a drop from an angle to get the splash in a different way.  The composition is strong, thanks for not centering it.  The shape of the cup gives it an almost sphere look.  Cool!</td>', 'I''m totally no one used a colored milk for one of these shots... like strawberry milk to change it up some.  Or how about a drop from an angle to get the splash in a different way.  The composition is strong, thanks for not centering it.  The shape of the cup gives it an almost sphere look.  Cool!', '2003-01-25 06:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
