(200134, 11160, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  interesting angle on the glass, nice even background.  i wonder what this would''ve looked like with milk in the glass.  the frosted glass looks a little dirty (even though i know it''s only the frosting) and the milk would''ve covered that.</td>', 'challenge met.  interesting angle on the glass, nice even background.  i wonder what this would''ve looked like with milk in the glass.  the frosted glass looks a little dirty (even though i know it''s only the frosting) and the milk would''ve covered that.', '2003-01-26 12:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(200141, 11208, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met, good catch.  i guess this wasn''t your first try because there are already quite a few crumbs in the milk.  a little bit distracting, but it''s not like you are going to filter or replace the mild for each shot.  pretty amazing that you got the oreo just the right way up and the splashes are pretty cool, too.  good frame to go with the picture.  :)</td>', 'challenge met, good catch.  i guess this wasn''t your first try because there are already quite a few crumbs in the milk.  a little bit distracting, but it''s not like you are going to filter or replace the mild for each shot.  pretty amazing that you got the oreo just the right way up and the splashes are pretty cool, too.  good frame to go with the picture.  :)', '2003-01-26 12:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
